\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -55\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Marcus Tullius Cicero}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De officiis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Am Ende Versus: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Excellunt cunctos hii libros philosophorum / Libri quos fecit tres Tulius \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 officiorum. Angustinus\plain \f0\fs22  (!). Ed.: Carl Friedrich Wilhelm M\u252 \'fcller (Hg.): Marci Tulli Ciceronis scripta quae manserunt omnia, Bd. 4,3. Leipzig 1890, S. 2-130. Anschlie\u223 \'dfend Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, Peregrinus Goch, Pavia, 1438: 55\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -57\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Kapitelverzeichnis, 57\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -59\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  systematisches Verzeichnis moralphilosophischer Begriffe sowie 59\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -60\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Versus duodecim sapientium}}\plain \f0\fs22  in epitaphio Marci Tullii Ciceronis. 12 x 3 Distichen. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 7951; 3361; 5348 (Abweichungen) u.a.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schaller/K\u246 \'f6nsgen, Initia, 1977}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 6448. Danach wieder Haupthand (s.o.).}

