\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -140\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bruno [Monachus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (Pseudo-Paterius B)\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Florilegium Commentariorum in Sacram Scripturam Sancti Gregorii Papae}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. Teil 2. Fragment am Ende. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Domino Wernero spons\u281 e virgine permansur\u281 e sacris nupciis copulato Bruno}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kapitelverzeichnis. (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Fili mi, si te lactaverint peccatores ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Prv 1,10)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Peccatores lactatur, cum vel perpetranda}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Reducat corda filiorum ad patres eorum\plain \f0\fs22  (Mal 4,6) || Text bricht ab. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 6317, Prol.; 13-15; 6318, Prol.; 1-15; Andr\u233 \'e9 Wilmart: Le recueil gr\u233 \'e9gorien de Paterius et les fragments wisigothiques de Paris. In: Revue B\u233 \'e9n\u233 \'e9dictine 39 (1927), S. 81-104, hier: S. 85-102 (Hs auf S. 99 genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt (43\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 49\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 . 53\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Glossen, Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge und Korrekturen von zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischen H\u228 \'e4nden.}

