\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 69\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -150\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Maphaeus Vegius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De perseverantia religionis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit erg\u228 \'e4nztem Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam ex ore veritatis illam cognovimus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (70\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Liber primus magistri Mathei Vegii De virtute perseverancie ...<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 graves sepe ut fit in rebus humanis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... conserendum pastinandumque veniemus. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit Liber de perseverancia religionis. Scriptus per me fratrem Hermannum Scholer de Erstorp conventualem in insula in opposito Valender anno M\u176 \'b0.cccc\u176 \'b0. sexagesimo septimo in profesto sanctissimi Nicolai episcopi et confessoris Christi \plain \f0\fs22 [5. Dez. 1467]\plain \f0\i\fs22 . Pro quo misereatur mei Deus omnium bonorum remunerator clementissimus<\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: Marguerin de la Bigne (Hrsg.): Maxima bibliotheca veterum patrum, Bd. 26. Lyon 1677, S. 688-754 (Abweichungen; ohne Prolog). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bertalot, Initia, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2.1, Nr. 5493. 150\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -151\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Bleistiftlinierung leer.}

