\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -118\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Hugo [de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De sacramentis [christianae fidei]}}\plain \f0\fs22 , li. II. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -1\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 )  Prolog. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -4\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Tabula. (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -118\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text. (118\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Liber iste sanct\u281 e MARI\u280 E matris Christi in BERGE conscriptus est anno incarnationis dominic\u281 e M.C.L.VI. indictione IIII iubente venerabili abbate HERIMANNO. \plain \f0\i\caps\fs22 Verbigeram patris red<dat dignatio matris / >Cordibus insertum nostris<.\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 176, Sp. 363-618\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Goy, Hugo von St. Viktor, 1976}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 134-152 (Hs auf S. 135 (Nr. 8) genannt); 510. Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberhand sowie zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischen H\u228 \'e4nden, teilweise auch mit Bleistift. 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  vorgesetzter Versus in Rot, kunstvoll horizontal und vertikal als {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Textzierseite}}\plain \f0\fs22  arrangiert: \plain \f0\i\caps\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\caps\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum patre regnator  / Et pneumate Christe creator / Unus in Usya }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\caps\fs22\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\caps\fs22\chcbpat17  / virtus patris atque Sophya / Da mundos corde / nos noys dilue sorde / Ut te noscamus / et amore tui sapiamus}}\plain \f0\i\caps\fs22 <\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  118\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -118\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb \plain \f0\fs22  Drei {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kommunionsgebete}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nachtrag, 13. Jh. Nr. 1 (118\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -118\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Dignare mihi prestare domine Jhesu trium panum gratie tue refectionem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 2 (118\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine Jhesu Christe, qui de hoc mundo ad patrem transisti}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (118\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) bis auf Bleistiftlinierung leer. Nr. 3 (118\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Domine, pater omnipotens, eterne Deus, intuere hanc sacrosanctam hostiam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...}

