ateinische Vorlage): Jean Leclercq / Henri Marie Rochais (Hgg.): S. Bernardi Opera, Bd. 4: Sermones 1. Rom 1966, S. 161-187; 191-262; 273-340 (Nr. 4-8; 10-15; 17-19; 23-29; 30-35); PL, Bd. 183, Sp. 501-514; 51-56 (Nr. 1-3; 9); Bd. 185, Sp. 29-32; 79-89 (Nr. 20; 35 = Guerricus Igniacensis); Bd. 184, Sp. 839-846; 827-832 (Nr. 16; 21 = Nicolaus Claraevallensis); Bd. 65, Sp. 729-732 (Claudius Gordianus Fulgentius). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Ermens/Van Dijk}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, S. 343-347; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Deschamps, Middelnederlandse Handschriften, 1972}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 254-256 (dat. um 1450). Teil\u252 \'fcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, SB, Cgm 5130, 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 ra}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -106}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 va}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 . 159}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 vb}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -173}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 rb}}\plain \f0\fs22  (Niederlande, 1471) vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 M SB Kat. 5.7}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 468-471 (Nr. 4-8; 11-15; 10; 17-24; 29; 26-28; 30-31); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Br\u252 \'fcssel, KglB, 11085}}\plain \f0\fs22  (Nr