\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 179\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -244\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tabula super libros Institutionum Lactantii}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Alphabetisches Personen- und Sachregister. Titel (von Rodem\u252 \'fcller nachgetragen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Firmianus Lactantius Institucionum suarum libro tali vel tali, capitulo tali vel tali. Antiquus theologus. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ablucio. Lactantius docet, quod corpus cito ablui potest}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... impios esse in penis et tenebris et concordant prophete libro 7\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  capitulo 7\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  versus finem. Amen. Explicit Tabula super libros Institucionum Lactantii. Deo gracias. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gotha, FuLB, Membr. I 55, 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -61}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22  (13. Jh.), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobs/Ukert, Beitr\u228 \'e4ge, 1835-43}}\plain \f0\fs22 , H. 3, S. 120f. (Nr. 141); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hopf, Handschriften der FuLB Gotha 1, 1994}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 41f.; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Oxford, BalliolC, 79, 228}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -313}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22  (K\u246 \'f6ln, 1442-1444), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mynors, Mss Balliol College Oxford, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 64f. (Nr. 79). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Schreiberhand. 244\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

