\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 253\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -255\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-?]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus de Langenstein}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus de] intelligentia [sive Expositio] in 'Nasci ex sanguinibus'}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Nota de intelligencia illius passus ewangeliste 'Qui non ex sanguinibus neque ex voluntate carnis neque ex voluntate viri sed ex Deo nati sunt'< \plain \f0\fs22 (Io 1,13). Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia interrogasti me, karissime, et plures hesitare narrasti de intelligencia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et quandoque ex singulis figuratur vita singulorum etc. >Explicit hoc de 'Nasci ex sanguinibus' editum a magistro Henrico Langensteyn dictus de Hassia sacre pagine doctore<. \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Suppl. (Bd. 9, S. 564), Nr. 3201,1; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hohmann, Heinrich von Langenstein, 1976}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 175; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lang, Christologie, 1966}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 58. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Schreiberhand.}

