\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 197\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -199\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Legenda] Sanctae Mechthildis de Scotia}}\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Van Sante Mechtelt van Schotland<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Het was een edel wael geboren joncfrouwe gheheiten Mechtelt, die des conincks dochter was}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sy was glorioes in voel myraculen te doen beide in haren leven ende nae haerre doot. >Et sic est finis. Deo gracias. Amen. Amen<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stammler, Mittelniederdeutsches Lesebuch, 1921}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 50f. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Williams-Krapp, Legendare, 1986}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 443; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 6, Sp. 270. 200\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

