\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ludolphus [de Saxonia]}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Christi}}\plain \f0\fs22 , pars I, cap. 1-40. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -3\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Tabula (partes I-IV). (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -4\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis (pars II). (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Fundamentum aliud nemo potest ponere, ait apostolus, preter id quod positum est}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  (I Cor 3,11)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Cum dicit }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Augustinus, quod Deus est res summe sufficiens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (10\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 De plenitudine itaque evangelii, quasdam guttas haurire cupientes}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... magistri valeas colligere. >Oracio<. Domine Jhesu Christe ... ut in te firmatus nullis a te separer temptacionibus. Amen. >Et sic finitur prima pars domini nostri Jhesu Christi secundum quadruplicem divisionem scripta per me fratrem Johannem Duysseldorff regularem professum in Marienclusen Treverensis dyocesis ac finita anno eiusdem domini nostri Jhesu Christi M.CCCC.LXVI\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  quarta feria in capite ieiunii<\plain \f0\fs22  [22. April 1466]. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Orate, obsecro, pro me\plain \f0\fs22  (gestrichen \plain \f0\i\fs22 misero\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 peccatore<\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: Auguste-Clovis Bolard u.a. (Hgg.): Ludolphus de Saxonia: Vita Jesu Christi. Paris u.a. 1865 (ND Salzburg 2006 = Analecta Cartusiana 241), S. 1-191 (Abweichungen). 187\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

