\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -172\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ludolphus [de Saxonia]}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Christi}}\plain \f0\fs22 , pars I, cap. 41-92. (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -2\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) leer. (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Lege ergo evangelica in monte tradita }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 consequenter ponitur eius confirmacio per miracula}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ubi et merces operum \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 restat, sint placere contenti, hec Beda. >Oratio<. Domine Jhesu Christe, fac mecum signum infirmitatis ... ac dirige in viam pacis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 et iusticie ac salutis et iusticie \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ac vite \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 eterne. Amen. \u8250 \'9bExplicit secunda pars vite domini scripta per me fratrem \plain \f0\fs22 (nachgetragen \plain \f0\i\fs22 Johannem\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  de Duysseldorp anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 .CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 .LXX\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  altera die post Symonis et Jude apostolorum \plain \f0\fs22 [29. Okt. 1470]\plain \f0\i\fs22 , cuius anima scripta sit in libro vite<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Auguste-Clovis Bolard u.a. (Hgg.): Ludolphus de Saxonia: Vita Jesu Christi. Paris u.a. 1865 (ND Salzburg 2006 = Analecta Cartusiana 241), S. 191-392 (Abweichungen). Vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand auf Rasur. 172\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  und 173\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

