\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - Teil I: (V-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 9\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 19\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 27\plain \f0\fs22  + (IV-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 34\plain \f0\fs22  + 2 IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 50\plain \f0\fs22  + 7 V\plain \f0\super\fs28 120\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 128\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 138\plain \f0\fs22 . Zwischenlage: IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 146\plain \f0\fs22 . Teil II: V\plain \f0\super\fs28 156\plain \f0\fs22  + (V-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 165\plain \f0\fs22 . Vereinzelt Reklamanten (I) \u8729 \'b7 Schriftraum: 18,5 \u215 \'d7 13,5 (I); 22,5 \u215 \'d7 15,5 (II) \u8729 \'b7  37-41 Z. (I); 35-38 Z. (II) \u8729 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22 , eine Hand (I); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , eine Hand (II) \u8729 \'b7 Rubrizierung (I) \u8729 \'b7 Eine {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kadelle}}\plain \f0\fs22  (6\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 )}

