\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -249\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Raimundus de Sabunde}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 [Theologia naturalis sive] Liber creaturarum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Incipit Liber nature sive creaturarum ... compositus a venerabili viro magistro Raymundo Sabunde}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad laudem et ad gloriam altissime trinitatis sanctissimeque Dei genitricis virginis Marie et tocius curie celestis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia homo naturaliter semper querit certitudinem et evidenciam claram}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... gaudia infinita et inexcogitabilia in eternum. Ad que dignetur nos perducere Jesus Christus, filius Dei, rex eterne glorie, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen. >Et sic est finis Libri creaturarum seu nature sive de homine, propter quem alie creature facte sunt, scripti per me fratrem Johannem Dusseldorp professum in Eberhartzclusen anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 LXXII\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 <. \plain \f0\fs22 Nachtrag: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Hic dilectus frater supprior \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 noviciorum extitit magister et discipline sancte zelator fervens ac depost sororum Sancte Agnetis rector et confessor, qui hac in domo obiit anno nostre salutis M.CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 LXXXII\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Joachim Sighart (Hg.): Raimundus de Sabunde: Theologia naturalis sive liber creaturarum. Sulzbach 1852 (ohne Prolog). Am Rand vereinzelte Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen sowie zwei in den Text integrierte Zeigeh\u228 \'e4nde (13\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 13\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ), Schreiberhand sowie andere H\u228 \'e4nde, letztes V. 15. Jh.}

