\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - Vorsatz: (II-2)\plain \f0\super\fs28 2\plain \f0\fs22  + 6 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 74\plain \f0\fs22  + (V-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 83\plain \f0\fs22  + 2 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 107\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-6)\plain \f0\super\fs28 113\plain \f0\fs22  + 2 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 137\plain \f0\fs22  + 2 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 161\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-5)\plain \f0\super\fs28 168\plain \f0\fs22  + 4 IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 200\plain \f0\fs22  + (IV-4)\plain \f0\super\fs28 204\plain \f0\fs22  + (V-3)\plain \f0\super\fs28 211\plain \f0\fs22  + 2 V\plain \f0\super\fs28 231\plain \f0\fs22  + (V-2)\plain \f0\super\fs28 238\plain \f0\fs22  + II\plain \f0\super\fs28 258\plain \f0\fs22 . \u220 \'dcberwiegend Lagensignaturen, separat f\u252 \'fcr I, II und IV-VIII \u8729 \'b7 Schriftraum 11 \u215 \'d7 7,5 (I-II); 12,5 \u215 \'d7 8,5 (II); 12 \u215 \'d7 8 (IV); 11 \u215 \'d7 7 (V); 11,5 \u215 \'d7 8 (VI); 12 \u215 \'d7 7,5 (VII); 12,5 \u215 \'d7 8,5 (VIII) \u8729 \'b7 21-34 Z. (I); 22-25 Z. (II); 35-37 Z. (III); 32-34 Z. (IV); 26-32 Z. (V); 29-31 Z. (VI); 32-34 Z. (VII); 21-22 Z. (VIII) \u8729 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde \u8729 \'b7 Rubrizierung \u8729 \'b7 Ein Schema (161\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u8729 \'b7 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Besitzvermerk: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Iste liber pertinet fratribus regularibus in Insula sub Confluencia in opposito Valinder\plain \f0\fs22  (!), letztes V. 15. Jh.; danach von gleicher Hand Inhaltsverzeichnis.}

