\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 132\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -135\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De vita domini}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Auszug (cap. 88-89: De suggestionibus diaboli\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 )\plain \f0\fs22 . Auszug aus einem Mosaiktraktat mit Exzerpten aus Werken von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Sophronius Eusebius Hieronymus}}\plain \f0\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Aurelius Augustinus}}\plain \f0\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Anselmus Cantuariensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Jheronimus: Arguendi sunt illi, qui cogitaciones a dyabolo immitti putant }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 [Comm. in Mt. 2,15,29]}}\plain \f0\i\fs22 ... \plain \f0\fs22 (134\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quod in verbis et sermonibus nostris considerare debemus quinque}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quia secundum evangelium attendere debent, si alius adversus eos quid habet.}

