\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -41\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Godefridus [Altissiodorensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Declamationes] de colloquio Simonis cum Jesu}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit prologus Gaufridi in librum de colloquio Symonis et Jhesu<.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Ende: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Expliciunt Sentencie beati Bernardi abbatis Clarevallensis. Deo gracias<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 184, Sp. 437-476 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ). Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Migne, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 71 (Godefridus Altissiodorensis). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt Glossen von Schreiberhand. 42\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

