\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 43\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -78\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus [de Paradiso]}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De arte bene moriendi}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Tractatus de arte bene moriendi editus a patre Jacobo Carthusiensi doctore circa annum domini Mccccl ...<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Omnes morimur et quasi aque dilabimur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Quod nobis concedere dignetur ille, qui est via, veritas et vita, Jhesus Christus, per secula benedictus. Amen. >Explicit Tractatus saluberrimus de arte bene vivendi et moriendi editus a quo supra<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Stanis\u322 law Andrzej Por\u281 ebski (Hg.): Jakub z Parady\u380 za: Pogl\u261 ady i teksty. Warszawa 1994, S. 95-135 (Hs auf S. 91 genannt). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Meier, Jakob von J\u252 \'fcterbog, 1955}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 47f. (Nr. 53; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rudolf, Ars moriendi, 1957}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 100f. (Hs mit falscher Signatur S 820 (!) genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mertens, Jacobus Carthusiensis, 1976}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 38 (Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 3623.}

