\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 152\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -153\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Missa de passione domini}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Prolog und Meditationen. Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quadam die Sanctus Bonifacius decumbens in lecto egritudinis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...<\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Introitus misse de passione domini: Humiliavit semetipsum ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Phil 2,8)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Versus: Misericordias domini in eternum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  Am Ende (152\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -153\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Meditationen: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Et sciendum quod in prima missa ammonendum est dominus noster}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...<. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Franz, Messe, 1902}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 158f. (Prolog und Messe; Abweichungen). \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Fulda, LB, B 12}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 95\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -96\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (Prolog, Text und Meditationen; Abweichungen), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 FD LB Kat. 2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 28. Nachtrag, 2.-3. V. 15. Jh. 153\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Exzerpte aus Thomas von Aquin und Guilelmus Durandus. Handwechsel. }

