\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 154\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -157\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Alexander [Neckam}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Meditationes de gestis domini nostri Jesu Christi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Erweiterte Fassung. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 149, Sp. 591-602 (Abweichungen). (157\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zusatz: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Jhesu qui promissis tanta pertulisti /}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... affluentes bonis. Amen. >Explicit opusculum. Peticio auctoris.< Tandem diligencia obsecro lectoris / Si quid hoc opusculo hausiret dulcoris / Allexandri \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 immemor ne sit peccatoris / Sed orando graciam rependat laboris.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Migne, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 61; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 4273; Mario Esposito: On some unpublished poems attributed to Alexander Neckam. In: The English Historical Review 30 (1915), S. 450-471, hier: S. 468 (Nr. 29).}

