\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 136\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -140\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Franciscus de Mayronis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo de Sancto Matthaeo}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Sequitur Sermo magistri Francisci de Maronis ordinis fatrum minorum de eo verbo domini, quod scriptum est 'Sequere me' ... et potest legi de Sancto Matheo apostolo et ewangelista<. \plain \f0\fs22 (136\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sequere me }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Mt 9,9)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . In istis verbis Christus omnes fideles suos in persona beati Mathei ad viam virtutis et perfeccionis vocat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... copulacio divine visionis et quedam dulcis pergustacio eterne felicitatis, quam nobis concedat Christus. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Kurz nach Beginn mitten im Text Handwechsel. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Roth, Franz von Mayronis, 1936}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 259f. (Nr. 29; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 1, 1969-1990}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 79 (Hs zwar genannt, aber Predigt nicht aufgef\u252 \'fchrt). \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 M\u252 \'fcnchen, SB, Cgm 634}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 95\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -99\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 M SB 5.4}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 293. Handwechsel.}

