\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 140\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -140\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Franciscus de Mayronis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo de incarnatione sive de quintuplici paupertate}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Nachtrag von zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischer Hand. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Idem Francisci Maronis in quodam sermone de incarnacione ...<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Dominus noster Jhesus Christus inclinavit se pro nobis usque ad infimam et extremam indigenciam et paupertatem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... hec paupertas inter alias est perfectissima et maxime imitanda gracia. >Hec de quintuplici paupertate dicta sufficiant<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Roth, Franz von Mayronis, 1936}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 259f. (Nr. 29; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 1, 1969-1990}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 79 (Hs zwar genannt, aber Predigt nicht aufgef\u252 \'fchrt).}

