\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 141\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -199\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Isidorus Hispalensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De summo bono}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 (I,9-10; I,17-II,39; II,45-III,62). Fragment am Anfang und in der Mitte wegen Blattverlust (s.o.). (199\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit liber beati Isidori Hispalensis episcopi de summo bono<. \plain \f0\fs22 Nachtrag: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Anno domini 1497 finitus et completus est liber iste in et pro domo Sancti Petri in Dalheym per manus fratris Arnoldi de Telget in officio sacrosanco<\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 83, Sp. 553f.; 576-642; 652-738 (vereinzelt Abweichungen).}

