\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -100\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Michael de Massa}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-Bonaventura}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  sive {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-Ludolphus de Saxonia}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Meditationes] Vitae Christi}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Kompilation und gek\u252 \'fcrzte Redaktion aus Ludolphus (Prolog) und Bonaventura (Text). \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Opusculum devotum de vita domini Jhesu Christi filii Dei. Prologus<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Fundamentum aliud ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (I Cor 3,11)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Cum sicut dicit Augustinus deus sit res summe sufficiens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... -\plain \f0\fs22  (6\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... speciosus forma pre filiis hominis. Inicium ergo ab incarnacione ... ac virginem gloriosam, de quibus primo videamus. \plain \f0\fs22 (6\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum per longissima tempora circa spacium quinque milium et fere dii centorum annorum miserabiliter genus humanum iaceret}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (99\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... aut si corrumpantur, sanes. \plain \f0\fs22 Zusatz: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Ut autem modum habeas, quem teneas in meditacione ... nec non in revelacionem omnis indigencie cordis et corporis singulorum. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Auguste-Clovis Bolard u.a. (Hgg.): Ludolphus de Saxonia: Vita Jesu Christi. Paris u.a. 1865 (ND Salzburg 2006 = Analecta Cartusiana 241), S. 1-5 (Prolog; K\u252 \'fcrzungen und Abweichungen); Adolphe Charles Peltrier: Bonaventurae opera omnia, Bd. 12. Paris 1868, S. 511-630 (Text; starke K\u252 \'fcrzungen und Abweichungen). Zu Verfasser und Werk (Kompilation) vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Zumkeller, Manuskripte, 1966}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 692. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 K\u246 \'f6ln, StArch, GB 4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 o}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  242, 1}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -104}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 K StA Kat. 2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 251f. (Lit.).}

