\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - III\plain \f0\super\fs28 6\plain \f0\fs22  + 6 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 78\plain \f0\fs22  + VII\plain \f0\super\fs28 92\plain \f0\fs22  + (IV+1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 101\plain \f0\fs22  + 3 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 137\plain \f0\fs22  + VII\plain \f0\super\fs28 151\plain \f0\fs22  + (V+1-3)\plain \f0\super\fs28 159\plain \f0\fs22  + 3 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 195\plain \f0\fs22  + (IX-7)\plain \f0\super\fs28 206\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 214\plain \f0\fs22  + VII\plain \f0\super\fs28 228\plain \f0\fs22  + VIII\plain \f0\super\fs28 244\plain \f0\fs22  + (III-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 249\plain \f0\fs22  + (IX-2)\plain \f0\super\fs28 265\plain \f0\fs22  + II\plain \f0\super\fs28 269\plain \f0\fs22  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 281\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 289\plain \f0\fs22  + 5 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 349\plain \f0\fs22  + II\plain \f0\super\fs28 353\plain \f0\fs22 . Zwischen Bll 94/95 und 285/286 je ein Schaltzettel. Teilweise Lagensignaturen. Vereinzelt Reklamanten \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum: 17,5 \u215 \'d7 11,5 (I); 17,5 \u215 \'d7 12 (II); 17,5-11 (III); 15,5 \u215 \'d7 11 (IV); 16,5 \u215 \'d7 12 (V); 17,5 \u215 \'d7 11 (VI); 16,5 \u215 \'d7 12 (VII); 16,5 \u215 \'d7 11,5 (VIII); 18,5 \u215 \'d7 12 (IX) \u183 \'b7 32-44 Z. (I); 29-37 Z. (II); 47-57 Z. (III); 30 Z. (IV); 26-41 Z. (V); 47-52 Z. (VI); 38-41 Z. (VII); 38-42 Z. (VIII); 52 Z. (IX) \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde \u183 \'b7 \u220 \'dcberwiegend Rubrizierung (I: 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -6\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt; 93\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -101\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  von zweiter Hand; III: Nur 160\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -167\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ; VI-VIII nicht ausgef\u252 \'fchrt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lombarden}}\plain \f0\fs22  vereinzelt mit Knospenfleuronn\u233 \'e9e (160\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 . 198\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Besitzvermerk: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Sanctorum Thome sum codex et Micolai\plain \f0\fs22  (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 pro Bursfeldensis utilitate domus\plain \f0\fs22 ; danach Inhaltsverzeichnis zum Codex, 1. Dr. 16. Jh.}

