\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -92\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Dionysius Carthusiensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Memoriale de quattuor hominis novissimis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipiunt Quatuor novissima Dyonisii Carthusiensis. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Gens absque consilio ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Dt 32,28-29)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Hec verba locutus est spiritus sanctus per Moysen}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et assidue meditemur ad laudem et gloriam omnipotentis, qui est super omnia, Deus sublimis et benedictus. Amen. >Explicit Memoriale quatuor novissimorum Dyonisii Carthusiensis<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Dionysii Cartusiani Opera omnia, Bd. 41. Tournai 1912 (Opera minora 9), S. 493-595. Zur Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. CCCM, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bd. 121, S. 249 (Nr. 147}}\plain \f0\fs22 ; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, Sp. 166-178, hier: Sp. 171 (Entstehung nach 1457). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Korrekturen, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde (darunter Schreiberhand), um 1500. Handwechsel.}

