\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 150\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -159\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Passio Sancti Ignatii}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Passio Sancti Ignatii episcopi et martiris incipit feliciter<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum Traianus Romanorum imperator suscepisset imperium}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... solemniter celebratur prestante domino nostro Jhesu Christo, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivit et regnat, Deus per immortalia secula seculorum. Amen. Explicit Passio beati Ignatii episcopi et martyris.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AASS}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Febr. I, S. 29-33. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 4256.}

