\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 200\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -201\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Richardus de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Remedia contra temptationibus sive] De pusillanimitate cordis}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Auszug. \plain \f0\i\fs22 Hugo de Sancto Victore. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Aliqui per cordis pusillanimitatem putant se desperare}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et laboriorius decertaverit; \plain \f0\fs22 danach Zusatz in kleinerer Schrift: \plain \f0\i\fs22 divina gracia aliquando visitat negligentes ut illuminet et suscitet ad bonam vitam.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 362; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kat. Basel B}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 150; Roger Baron: Hugues de Saint-Victor: Contribution \u224 \'e0 un nouvel examen de son \u339 \'9cuvre. In: Traditio 15 (1959), S.  223-297, hier: S. 241, Anm. 114. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch Mainz, StB, {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hs I 215}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 b}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 , 102}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -103}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22 . 106\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 MZ StB Kat. 2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 244 (dieses Exzerpt, aber ohne Zusatz). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt Korrekturen, zwei H\u228 \'e4nde, 2. H. 15. Jh.}

