\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 245\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -248\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Trithemius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo [sive oratio] de ruina ordinis Sancti Benedicti [et de laudibus reformationis Bursfeldensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Sermo per dominum abbatem Spanheimensem Erffordie tempore capituli annali habitus anno 1492<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Videns Jesus civitatem flevit ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Lc 19,41)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Venerabiles et religiosi patres, quamvis mihi verecundum sit coram vestris patribus exordiri sermonem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... glorifica gubernans ac moderans secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Johannes Busaeus (Hg.): Joannis Trithemii ... opera pia et spiritualia. Mainz 1605, S. 850-856. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Arnold, Trithemius, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 234. Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand. 249\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

