\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 12\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 23\plain \f0\fs22  + 5 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 83\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-2)\plain \f0\super\fs28 93\plain \f0\fs22  + 5 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 153\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 164\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-8)\plain \f0\super\fs28 168\plain \f0\fs22  + 3 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 204\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 214\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI-6)\plain \f0\super\fs28 220\plain \f0\fs22  + 3 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 256\plain \f0\fs22 . Lagenz\u228 \'e4hlung (z.T. separat). Teilweise Reklamanten (I-III). Zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssische Foliierung \plain \f0\i\fs22 1-159\plain \f0\fs22 . Zwischen Bll 14/15 ein Blatt sowie zwischen Bll 94/95 zwei Bl\u228 \'e4tter entfernt (Textverlust) \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum 15 \u215 \'d7 10,5 (I-III);  15,5 \u215 \'d7 10 (IV); 17 \u215 \'d7 10,5 (V); 17 \u215 \'d7 10 (VI); 16 \u215 \'d7 10 (VII); 17 \u215 \'d7 10,5 (VIII-IX) \u183 \'b7 Vereinzelt 2 Sp. (170\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -177\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 248\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 35-38 Z. (I-III); 32-37 Z. (IV); 34-38 Z. (V); 35-40 Z. (VI); 37-41 Z. (VII); 47-52 Z. (VIII-IX) \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , zwei H\u228 \'e4nde (Georgius de Novo Foro u.a.) \u183 \'b7 Rubrizierung (bis auf 137\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -156\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 . 181\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 208\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -211\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 Mehrere Schemata (91\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 93\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 252\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 254\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 256\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 I\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Inhaltsangabe,  danach Besitzvermerk und Signaturen: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Carmeli Boppardiensis, Classis 7\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 mae\plain \f0\i\fs22 , Lin: I\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 a\plain \f0\i\fs22 , Num: 33\plain \f0\fs22 , 17./18. Jh.; II\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Besitzvermerk: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Sunt in hoc volumine per patrem Georgium de Novo Foro conventus nostri Wormatiensis circa annum 1392 priorem conscripta multa valde utilia, et ad antiquitatis memoriam, quae bene asserventur dignissima. Inter caetera primo loco commendari meretur tratatus, qui intitulatur >Formula vitae regularis<, ubi pro religiosa conversatione praeclarissima praecepta tradit et documenta\plain \f0\fs22 , 17./18. Jh.}

