\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 170\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -177\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 auctoritates patrum de contemptu mundi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Zwei Mosaiktraktate mit Exzerpten aus Bernardus Claraevallensis, Boethius, Augustinus, Seneca, Plinius, Gregorius Magnus, Ambrosius Mediolanensis, Hieronymus, Isidorus Hispalensis, Johannes Chrysostomus u.a. (170\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -174\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Traktat 1: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Multi multa sciunt et se ipsos nesciunt}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in dilectione eternorum in contemptu temporalium in sustinentia contrariorum etc. >Tu autem domine miserere nobis etc.<\plain \f0\fs22  Danach Verse: >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Pax est in cella / Foris autem nil nisi bella. / Si pacem queris / Hinc rarius egredieris}}\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 13894. Danach lat.-westmd. Mischverse: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Munera da summis / Si machent recht dais crum is / Si desit hoc nummus / Ten wirt dir nit da yt um is}}\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  (174\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -177\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Traktat 2: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Homo, securum accessum habes ad Deum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... cum prole pia benedicat virgo Maria. Amen etc.\plain \f0\fs22  177\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtrag: [Expositio in Io 8,47]. >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Qui ex Deo est ...< }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Io 8,47)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Augustinus dicit, quod nullum maius signum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22 178\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -180\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

