\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 221\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -225\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Accentuarius paenultimarum syllabarum}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Kurzfassung. \u220 \'dcbergeschrieben vom Schreiber der Teile IV-VII: \plain \f0\i\fs22 In nomine domini. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Accentuarius penultimarum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quia inter sillabarum accentus maxime videtur pro sacra }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 scripture congrua seu debita expressione}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... v ante v >breviatur<. Producitur ut iuvo etc. >Explicit Accentuarius penultimarum sillabarum<. \plain \f0\fs22 \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Oxford, Merton College, 113 (N.2.11)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 129\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -141\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Oxford?, 1377, Schreiber \plain \f0\i\fs22 Cade\plain \f0\fs22  f\u252 \'fcr Johannes Risborough, Kaplan und Fellow am Merton College), vgl. Rodney Malcolm Thomson: A Descriptive Catalogue of the Medieval Manuscripts of Merton College, Oxford. Cambridge 2009, S. 96 (m. Abb. 60; Langfassung); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bursill-Hall, Census, 1981}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 197.2; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BAMAT}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 20, Nr. 4048. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Schreiberhand.}

