plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 33a; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1804d (Hs genannt).}

