inst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum religiosus accipiens propria auctoritate aliquid de communibus bonis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 7 (94\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum prelatus subdito audiri confessiones possit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 8 (94\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum prelatus possit committere subdito casus a iure non concessos}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 9 (94\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -95\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum prelatus inferior possit confessum sibi de casibus ad se pertinentibus absolvere}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 10 (95\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum superior prelatus possit commitere inferiori potestatem condicionalem absolvendi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 11 (95\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -96\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum subditus habens peccatum occultum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 12 (96\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -98\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[11].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Utrum absque omni peccato liceat transgredi precepta penalia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 35a; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1806a (Hs genannt). Textanf\u228 \'e4nge anf\u228 \'e4nglich von Kalteisen vorgeschrieben, gegen Ende von ihm erg\u228 \'e4nzt. Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen (u.a. Querverweise auf die Dominikanertheologen {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas [de Aquino]}}\plain \f0\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Humbertus [de Romanis}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]: Interpretatio super regula [Sancti Augustini], und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus [de Arvernia}}\plain \f0\fs22 : Improbationes] contra Henricum de Gandavo).}

