\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 128\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -133\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Replica contra aliquas propositiones tractatus de toto Christo Augustini de Roma}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Beigaben. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Replicaturus pro voto meo contra aliquas proposiciones, quas ponit dominus Augustinensis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) [Augustinus]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  de Roma}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quoniam bonorum nostrorum non indiget.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Eckermann, Opera inedita, 1978}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 115-129 (Nr. 5). Zum Werk vgl. ebd., S. 24 (Nr. 7; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 973f. (Nr. 18b; dat. 1435; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1790 (I; dat. Basel, 1435; Hs genannt). Inseriert: (130\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -132\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Augustinus Favaroni de Roma}}\plain \f0\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Defensorium sacramenti unitatis Christi et ecclesiae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Erste, l\u228 \'e4ngere Rezension, Exzerpte von Kalteisen: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Fundamentum istius domini}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in causa Rome.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Eckermann, Opera inedita, 1978}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 75-83. Zum Werk vgl. ebd., S. 21 (Nr. 2; Hs genannt); VL (2), Bd. 4, Sp. 974 (Nr. 20; Hs genannt). Zweite Rezension s.u. (142\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -143\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen. 134\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  leer. 134\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -135\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Beigabe: \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Heinrich Kalteisen:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Conclusiones extractae ex libello [Augustini de Roma}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Primus articulus in concilio Basiliensi }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (gestrichen; ersetzt }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Constanciensi}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  fuit condempnatus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quia membra eius peccant.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Eckermann, Opera inedita, 1978}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 185-189 (Anh. Nr. 1). Zum Werk vgl. ebd., S. 25f. (Nr. 10; Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen.}

