\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 168\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -174\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilium de regula Sanctae Clarae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Zweite Fassung. Titel (von Kalteisen erg\u228 \'e4nzt): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Responsio magistri Henrici Kaltisen magistri sacre palacii ad quattuor questiones tangentes regulam Sancte Clare.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Venerabili patri }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (von Kalteisen erg\u228 \'e4nzt)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  in Christo Jhesu karissimo, religionis beatissimi patriarche Francisci professori et vicario emerito fratri Jacobi de Bononia frater Henricus Kaltysen ... salutem et caritatis perfectionem. Ostensa michi regula per almificum patrem Franciscum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sanctissimus patriarcha Franciscus. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Creytens, Opuscule, 1968}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 57-69. Zum Werk vgl. ebd., S. 47-56 (dat. vor 5. Febr. 1447, s.o.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 34); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1805a (Hs genannt). Geschrieben von der bereits bei der Konzeptfassung (159\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -163\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 , s.o.) t\u228 \'e4tigen Hand (159\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -160\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Kalteisen. Handwechsel.}

