\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 174\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -178\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilia de dispensatione et potestate papae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Sammlung von drei Konsilien: Nr. 1 (174\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est an papa possit facere duos episcopos eiusdem ecclesie ita quod quilibet eorum sit equalis potestatis in solidum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... circa leccionem crastinam. Hoc offero pauculum.\plain \f0\fs22  Nr. 2 (174\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -176\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa dispensacione pape quesita sunt multa. Primum an aliquid, quod est per se illicitum, fiat licitum per dispensacionem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ex sola commissione legis conditoris superioris legem potest interpretari. \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 3 (176\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -178\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est de potestate, quam habet in rebus temporalibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... extra regnum suum non sibi subditos. \plain \f0\fs22 Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 33e; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1804c (Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen zahlreiche Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen.}

