\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 181\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilium de dispensatione papae in matrimonium}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Erste Fassung (Konzept). \u220 \'dcbergeschrieben: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Id quod hic sequitur legere dignetur serenitas vestra. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est an papa possit et debeat dispensare cum nobili viro, qui contraxit matrimonium cum A., que erat filia B., sed non consumavit illud matrimonium per carnalem copulam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... videtur esse causa legittima \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  eo modo quo pretactum est ergo etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 33f; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1804b (Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Kalteisen.}

