\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 182\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -185\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilium de meliori praelatu}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est an ille peccet }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (gestrichen }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 et quantum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 , qui obligatus ex officio providere alicui ecclesie de pastore ydoneo sciens pro illius ecclesie regimine tres valentes}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quam opto bona domini celestis in terra viventem apprehendere. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 33g; Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen zahlreiche Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Kalteisen.}

