\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 185\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Heinrich Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilia de dispensatione et venditione officiorum in curia Romana}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von drei Konsilien: Nr. 1 (185\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quidam frater minoris ordinis antequam fuerat factus religiosus commisit multa homicidia non manu sed consilio et auxilio petit dispensacionem}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et Machabei bellatores et sacerdotes erant.\plain \f0\fs22  Nr. 2 (185\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est quo Teucri }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!; f\u252 \'fcr }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Turci}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  sepe devastant regnum Ungarie educentes secum in captivitatem multa milia hominum reliquuntur viri multi spoliati suis uxoribus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... nulla finis in benediccione potest fieri ut liceat.\plain \f0\fs22  Nr. 3 (186\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quesitum est an vendere officia in curia Romana}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... non commites symoniam. Incertum, si feceris.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Kalteisen.}

