\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 243\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -312\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Marienwerder}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Expositio symboli apostolorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Tabula. Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Venite ambulemus ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Is 2,5)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Qui volumus, prout debemus, in fide credibilium proficere}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (249\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... sacrilegium sacramenta derelinquere inperfecta. Et sic est finis prologi. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Credo in Deum ... In hoc symbolo fides benedicte trinitatis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (307\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... qui stas in lictore celestis patrie me exspecans per Jhesum Christum dominum nostrum, salvatorem omnium, qui tecum vivit et regnat in unitate spiritus sancti per omnia secula seculorum et cum spiritu tuo. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 (307\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -312\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Tabula: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Pro tabula expositionis symboli apostolorum est sciendum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Explicit Tabula exposicionis symboli apostolorum.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Marian Borzyszkowski: Jana z Kwidzyna Prolog do 'Expositio symboli apostolorum'. In: Textus et studia historiam theologiae in Polonia exculae spectantia, vol. II, fasc. 2, Warszawa 1943, S. 9-61, hier: S. 13-38 (Prolog). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 4780 (Prolog; Text); 4780,1 (Tabula).}

