\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 33\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -36\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Responsio [Eugenii IV. Papae] ad petitionem regis Franciae de concilio novo}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Konzept der ersten Fassung (ohne Prolog). Titel (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Contra 3\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 m\plain \f0\i\fs22  locum seu novum concilium collectum per te \plain \f0\fs22 [Papst Eugen IV., s.u.] \plain \f0\i\fs22 ad respondendum Francis\plain \f0\fs22 . (33\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) leer. (34\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Titel (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Responsio ad peticionem regis Francie de concilio novo in Gallia.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Regnans in excelsis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sero medicina paratur. \plain \f0\fs22 Zum Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 109 (Nr. 2); 164 (Anm. 9; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 29); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1800 (dat. Florenz, Jan. 1442). Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonn, ULB, S 326, 115}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -121}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22  (erste Fassung, mit Prolog). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen. Handwechsel.}

