\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 62\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -64\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Franciscus [de Capodilista}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Acta concilii Basiliensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Auszug (Textanfang)\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 Acta concilii Basiliensis \plain \f0\fs22 (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen \plain \f0\i\fs22 concepta per gloriosum militem et doctorem Johannem Francisci\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Virtute decreti Constantiensis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (erg\u228 \'e4nzt }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 concilii}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 ordinatum fuit tempore Martini quinti in civitate Basilee}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... patet nequicia Basiliensium multiplex, quod postmodum determinationem superaddiderunt.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 109 (Nr. 7; Hs genannt). \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Cambridge, CorpusChristiC, Ms. 157}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -108\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (Basel, Sammelhs mit Konzilsakten, 1439-1441; Textdatierung N\u252 \'fcrnberg, 10. Febr. 1439, vollst\u228 \'e4ndige Fassung), vgl. Montague Rhodes James: A Descriptive Catalogue of the Manuscripts in the Library of Corpus Christi College, Bd. 1. Cambridge 1909-1912, S. 355. Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand. Handwechsel.}

