\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 71\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -72\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo?-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Petrus de Palude}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Petri de Godino}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?)]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Materia decreti irritantis}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 , Auszug (6,3 (Ende): De causa immediata ecclesiasticae potestatis)}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Titel (am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Natura decreti irritantis. Petrus de Palude in fine de ecclesiastica potestatis immediacione. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Potestas iurisdictionis in papa est a Christo immediate}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sed certum enim, quod irrationabiliter ageret et peccaret etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: William David McCready (Hg.): The Theory of Papal Monarchy in the Fourteenth Century. Guillaume de Pierre Gaudin: Tractatus de causa immediata ecclesiastice potestatis. Toronto 1982 (Studies and texts 56), S. 295-299 (Z. 1337-1447). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 110 (Nr. 9; Hs genannt); Dirk van den Auweele: A propos de la tradition manuscrite du 'De causa immediata ecclesiastice potestatis' de Guillaume de Pierre Godin <1336>. In: Recherches de la th\u233 \'e9ologie ancienne et m\u233 \'e9di\u233 \'e9vale 51 (1984), S. 183-205 (Hs auf S. 188 genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kr\u228 \'e4mer, Konsens, 1980}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 25f. (Anm. 34); 59-62 (Nr. 7; dat. Basel, nach 18. Mai 1433; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1632. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Kalteisen. 72\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

