\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -98\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones de potestate papae et imperatoris}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von sechs Quaestionen, vgl. dazu {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 110 (Nr. 12; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1808 (Hs genannt). Nr. 1 \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 (\plain \f0\fs22 86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quare Romani perdiderunt imperium. Solvit hanc questionem Sanctus Augustinus libro 5\u176 \'b0 de civitate Dei capitulo 13 dicens }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (vorgeschrieben von Kalteisen).}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  Quales fuerunt tunc Romam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quam ius elligendi \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 imperatorem perdiderunt. \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kurz, Hss \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5,2, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 120; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1808b (Hs genannt). Handwechsel. Nr. 2 (86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 De donatione Constantini quam fecerunt pape. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa donacionem, quam fecit Constantinus, queruntur tria }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (vorgeschrieben von Kalteisen)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 : Primo utrum Constantinus potuerit pape partem concedere}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...  \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 3 (87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -88\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 De imperatoris confirmatione et coronacione \plain \f0\fs22 (erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Deinde considerandus est de imperatorum confirmacione, circa quod queruntur 4}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\super\fs28\chcbpat17 or}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 : Primo utrum per papam imperator electus debeat confirmari}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sed debet bene recognoscere superiorem scilicet vicarium illius, qui est verus Deus et verus homo. Et sic finitur. \plain \f0\fs22 Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 976 (Nr. 39; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1808c (Hs genannt). Handwechsel. Nr. 4 (88\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -94\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 De regis consecracione \plain \f0\fs22 (am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Consecrantur quoque reges nota, quod apud gentiles non leguntur aliqui ascendisse ad regiam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Et sic ad imperium lancea illa delata est.\plain \f0\fs22  Ab 90\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  von Kalteisen geschrieben. Nr. 5 \plain \f0\i\fs22 (\plain \f0\fs22 94\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -96\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  De consecracione regine \plain \f0\fs22 (am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Consecrari eciam solent regine Christiane, nam et speciales oraciones fiunt super eas}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quia in capite est perspicacitas intellectus. \plain \f0\fs22 Zwischen Bl 96/97 f\u252 \'fcnf (leere) Bll herausgeschnitten. Nr. 6 (97\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -98\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Cerimonia \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  coronacionis imperatori. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Primo papa recipit eum papa sedente in capite graduum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... tunc ad thalamum reducta ibi usque ad finem misse permaneat. Et sic est finis.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 976 (Nr. 39; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[7].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1808d (Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Kalteisen, dabei teilweise Titel, Kapitelanf\u228 \'e4nge und betr\u228 \'e4chtliche Textpassagen von ihm vorgeschrieben und erg\u228 \'e4nzt. 98\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer. Handwechsel.}

