\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 128\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -130\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 127\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo in festo Sanctorum Petri et Pauli sive] Responsio [de indulgentiis]}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Erste Fassung. \plain \f0\i\fs22 Prima collectura pro responsione fienda per concilium super epistola prescripta proferenda \plain \f0\fs22 (gestrichen \plain \f0\i\fs22 dominica adventus 2\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 a\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum omne datum optimum, quoad ad naturalia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... signaculum fidei perseverando in fide non ficta etc. Ut supra.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 46-50; 111 (Nr. 21; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1788a. Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen vereinzelt Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Kalteisen. 127\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

