\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 131\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -132\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Aurelius Augustinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus Claraevallensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Maximinus Episcopus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Leo I. Papa}}\plain \f0\fs22  [u.a.\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones in festo] sanctorum Petri et Pauli}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Materialsammlung (Exzerpte) f\u252 \'fcr den vorangehenden und die folgenden Texte (128\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -130\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 127\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 . 138\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -141\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ). (131\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -132\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 39, Sp. 2125-2127; 2122-2123 (Augustinus); Bd. 183, Sp. 405-408 (Bernardus). (132\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Natalem apostolorum celebramus, quorum memoriam universus mundus amplectitur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (Ps.-Augustinus). (132\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) Ed.: PL, Bd. 57, Sp. 391-396 (Maximinus); Bd. 39, Sp. 2119f. (Augustinus); 2120f. = Bd. 57, Sp. 402-405 (Maximinus); Bd. 54, Sp. 426-428 (Leo). Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 47, Anm. 39; 111 (Nr. 22; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kurz, Hss \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5,2, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 120 (Augustinus: Sermo app. 203, app. 205 u.a.).}

