\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 133\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -134\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 sermo in festo Sanctorum Petri et Pauli}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ].\plain \f0\fs22  Entwurf. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Principes populorum congregati sunt ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 46,10)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Principes populorum, cetus est beatissimorum duodecim apostolorum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quam plures crediderunt domino, ut testatur Dyonisius in epistola prefata\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 47 (Kalteisen?). 134\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

