\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 138\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -141\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo in festo Sanctorum Petri et Pauli sive] Responsio [de indulgentiis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Zweite Fassung. Basel, 1435. \plain \f0\i\fs22 In festo beatorum Petri et Pauli apostolorum Basilee 1435. Responsio ad epistolam prescriptam, quam fecit synodus Christo collecta et recitata per fratrem Henricum Kaltisen ordinis predicatorum, in sacra pagina professorem ac pravitatis heretice inquisitorem Maguntinensem. In nomine beatissime trinitatis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 A quo omne datum optimum quoad ad naturalia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quem iterum et in eternum laudamus et benedicimus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Danach kurzer Abla\u223 \'dfvermerk. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schneyer, Repertorium 2, 1990-1994}}\plain \f0\fs22 , s.v. 'Henricus Kalteisen', Nr. 5 (leichte Abweichung am Anfang; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 46-50 (dat. Basel, vor 29. Juni 1435); 111 (Nr. 23; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 973 (Nr. 16; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1788b (Hs genannt).}

