\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 251\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -252\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Oratio] in congregatione praelatorum regni Franciae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Entwurf (Fragment). \plain \f0\i\fs22 In congregacione prelatorum regni Francie. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Imitaturus eius vestigia, cuius in terris unicus est vicarius}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ostendit discredentem unum fidei articulum hereticum esse quasi nullum credent[em]. Amittit enim fidei ||\plain \f0\fs22  Text bricht ab. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 112 (Nr. 34); 157 (Anm. 47; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, Sp. 975 (Nr. 31; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1802 (dat. 1442/1443; Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen.}

