\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 284\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -286\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Petrus de Monte}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?):] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Oratio ad principem Britanniae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Fragment am Ende. \plain \f0\i\fs22 Oratio ad principem Britanie. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Si quid unquam summo desiderio exspectavi, illustrissime princeps, hec est illa dies}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quesyerat summa et detestabili avidita[te] || \plain \f0\fs22 Text bricht ab. Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Pr\u252 \'fcgl, Ekklesiologie, 1995}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 112 (Nr. 36; Hs genannt). Am Rand sowie zwischen den Zeilen Glossen, Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Korrekturen von Kalteisen.}

