\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Handschriftenzensus Rheinland}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 170. - Rudolphus Theodorus Maria van Dijk: Twee onbekende Middelnederlandse statutenboeken uit de Sint-Trudoabdij te Odergem. In: Serta devota in memoriam Guillelmi Lourdoux. Pars prior: Devotio Windeshemensis. Leuven 1992 (Mediaevalia Lovaniensia, Ser. 1, Studia 20), S. 203-222, hier: S. 204 (Anm. 8). - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kr\u228 \'e4mer, Handschriftenerbe, 1989-1990}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 409; 448; 455 (Besitzprovenienzen falsch). - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Van Dijk, Constituties, 1986}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 116-119. - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kurz, Hss \u220 \'dcberlieferung Augustinus 5,2, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 121. - Becker, S. [231f.]. - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rheinische Handschriften Bonn}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 21. - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Klette/St\u228 \'e4nder}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 352.}

