\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -68\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Butzbach}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Relatio sive Peroratio de laudibus et virtutibus Jacobi de Vredis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Argumentum von Jacobus Siberti (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) und Widmungsbrief an Valerius von Mayen (4. M\u228 \'e4rz 1511). (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -3\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Widmungsbrief: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Devoto et amantissimo in Christo confratri Valerio suo frater Johannes Piemontanus prior ... Postulasti dudum a me}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -68\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Congregatio nostra sit in nomine domini ...< Sacerdotes eius induam ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 131,9)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Religiosi ac charissimi patres ... Ego quidem haud immerito}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ad quem ipsum patrem seniorem nostrum Jacobum confidentes pervenisse nullatenus dubitamus. Cui est laus, salus et benedictio, honor et gloria atque potestas per infinita secula seculorum. >Amen. Dixi<. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Finit Oratio Johannis Butzbagii Piemontani in commendationem Jacobi monachi ad cetum fratrum tempore minutionis in loco capitulari habita tandemque fratri Valerio eiusdem senioris celle heredi, qui et transcripsit, eam in hanc formam nuncupata. MDXI<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zum Werk vgl. VL Hum., Bd. 1, Sp. 345 (Nr. 9); Resmini, Laach, 1993, S. 416f.; Beriger, Odeporicon, 1991, S. 50; 84f. (P.9).}

