\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -48\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Butzbach}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Odeporicon}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Widmungsbrief von Butzbach an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Philippus Haustulus}}\plain \f0\fs22  (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -1\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 , 1506). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Iam dudum postulasti atque adhuc usque petis a me}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Anno igitur primo nativitatis mee}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Vale. Ex Lacu Kalendas Aprilis >anno domini< 15[0]6\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Beriger, Odeporicon, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 128-343. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL Dt. Hum.}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, Sp. 343 (B.4); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Beriger, Odeporicon, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 49 (P.4); 91-124; 345-439. \u220 \'dcberwiegend von Butzbach und Valerius von Mayen unter Mithilfe von Gregorius Guolteri sowie einer weiteren Hand geschrieben (zahlreiche Handwechsel).}

