\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 49\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -130\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Butzbach}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De illustribus seu studiosis doctisque mulieribus}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Widmungsbrief von Butzbach an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Aleidis Raescop}}\plain \f0\fs22  (49\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -51\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 , 1505) und Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen (129\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -130\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 , 1510-1511). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quod ego et Jacobus meus inutilis nostris versiculis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (52\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) leer. (53\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Eva omnium nostrum, qui fuerunt, sunt et in futurum erunt prima parens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (128\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... a quovis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 iusto censeri habeam. \plain \f0\fs22 (129\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ursula Cantoris natione Germana}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... nil dumtaxat ex Gersone huc usque innotuit quod latuit temporibus suis.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed. (Ausz\u252 \'fcge): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Fertig, Butzbach, 1907}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 33-56. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL Dt. Hum.}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, Sp. 342 (B.1); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Beriger, Odeporicon, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 49; 58-60 (P.1). \u220 \'dcberwiegend von Butzbach unter Mithilfe von Valerius von Mayen, Gregorius Guolteri sowie einer weiteren Hand geschrieben (zahlreiche Handwechsel). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Butzbach. 130\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

