\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 131\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -138\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Butzbach}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Libellus de praeclaris picturae professoribus}}\plain \f0\fs22 . 1505. Mit Widmungsbrief von Butzbach an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gertrud von B\u252 \'fcchel}}\plain \f0\fs22  (131\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -131\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum advenienti dudum ad monasterium nostrum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (132\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Tradunt scripta gentilium quam plurimos huiusce pictorie artis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... eulogia non occurrunt. Vale ex Lacu et ora pro me Deum. 1505. \u932 ?\u949 e\u955 ?\u959 ?\u962 ?.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Otto Pelka (Hg.): Johannes Butzbach: Von den ber\u252 \'fchmten Malern, 1505. Heidelberg 1925, S. 27-37 (mit Faksimile). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL Dt. Hum.}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, Sp. 342 (B.2); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Beriger, Odeporicon, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 49; 58f. (P.2). Am Rand einmal Glosse von Butzbach (134\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ). Geschrieben von Butzbach.}

