\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -15\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus Siberti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 epitoma metrica in regulam Sancti Benedicti}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lat. mit griechischen Einsprengseln. Mit Widmungsbrief (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 , 28. Sept. 1508) sowie zwei Versprologen (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 . 3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -4\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) von Siberti an Johannes Trithemius. Widmungsbrief: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cogitanti mihi cui potissimum lucubraciunculam meam metricam in sanctissimi patris nostri regulam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Erster Versprolog:\plain \f0\i\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Inter doctiloquos maximus es viros}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  / ... \plain \f0\fs22 (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zweiter Versprolog:\plain \f0\i\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Exigit utilitas quo nil preciosius evi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  / ... \plain \f0\fs22 (4\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ausculta o fili patris precepta benigni}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  / ... Cui laus, imperium, virtus, decus omne per evum. \plain \f0\fs22 Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Richter, Schriftsteller, 1898}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 281f. 15\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtrag, sehr wahrscheinlich von Siberti (Handvergleich mit Bonn, ULB, S 247, 92\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ), 1509/1519: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannnes Curvello}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epigramma in Jacobi Siberti Epitomam metricam in regulam Sancti Benedicti}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. ebd., S. 338-340, v.a. S. 340 (Nr. 7).}

