\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 21\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -22\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus Siberti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?):] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Argumenta duodecim de vita regulari monachorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Duodecim sunt regularis vite argumenta, que in monasteriis observata magnam pacem generant<. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Relligione }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 sacra perit observantia norme}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  / ... - ... Continue in claustro durans, mihi crede, vigebit.\plain \f0\fs22  Zuweisung an Siberti wegen des \u220 \'dcberlieferungskontextes.}

