\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 22\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -23\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus Siberti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De duodecim gradibus humilitatis et superbiae secundum regulam Sancti Benedicti}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Widmung von Siberti an Valerius von Mayen. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Ad religiosum devotumque fratrem Valerium de Meyn\plain \f0\fs22  (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 monachum in Lacu commilitonem suum charissimum de xii gradibus humilitatis secundum regulam Sancti Benedicti\plain \f0\fs22 <. (22\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -23\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sunt quibus ascendunt homines ad celica regum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  /\plain \f0\fs22  ... - ... \plain \f0\i\fs22 Deiice teque puta criminis esse reum\plain \f0\fs22 . (23\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Zwischentitel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >De duodecim gradibus superbie ad eundem<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ast graduum series duodena superbus in istis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  / ... - ... Consuetudo mala peccandi sit duodeno.\plain \f0\fs22  Zuweisung an Siberti wegen der Angaben im Titel.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 24\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -104\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus Siberti}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Liber de calamitatibus huius temporis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Widmungsbrief von Siberti an Trithemius (24\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -25\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum mecum, vir doctissime, humani generis efusissima flagicia repeto}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (25\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quis, ut a domo Dei exordiar, paucis eloqui posset cleri flagicia, sacerdotum avariciam et luxuriam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quanto ab illicitis corpus arctius edomatur.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Johann Karl Ludwig Gieseler: Jacobi Siberti Monachi Lacensis de calamitatibus huius temporis liber. In: Kirchenhistorisches Archiv von K. F. St\u228 \'e4udlin, H. G. Tschirner und J. S. Vater f\u252 \'fcr 1826, H. 2. Halle 1826, S. 109-211, hier: S. 113-211 (Hs genannt; nur leichte K\u252 \'fcrzungen). Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Richter, Schriftsteller, 1898}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 286. Am Rand vereinzelt Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge und Korrekturen von der Schreiberhand und einer weiteren zeitgen\u246 \'f6ssischen Hand (24\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

