\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -10\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas Halensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De vita [seu genealogia beatae] Mariae virginis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Prolog. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Prologus in vitam gloriose semperque virginis Marie<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vitam virginis gloriose matris >Jhesu Christi< Marie cum eiusdem omnipotentis >Jhesu Christi< opitulacione}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et dulcissimo filio suo domino Jhesu Christo recommendavit. \plain \f0\fs22 (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sancta et superlaudabilis et semper virgo Dei genitrix }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 >Maria< preeterno consilio Dei predestinata}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (10\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... vel nosce, dulcissime Jhesu, tu et tui. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach zus\u228 \'e4tzliches Kapitel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Epyphanius episcopus dicit, quod beata septennis in templo}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Item erat sine pretio et sine scemate et non fulturata. >Explicit vita Marie semper virginis ex dictis doctorum collecta atque conscripta etc.<\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mohan, Initia, 1975-1978}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 394; 494; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kat. Basel B}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 829 (ohne Prolog; Abweichungen am Ende; Lit.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 FR UB Kat. 1.3}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 61 (ohne Prolog). Am Rand Glossen von Schreiberhand. 10\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

