\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 11\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -49\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vincentius Bellovacensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De laudibus beatae Mariae virginis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Erweiterte Fassung (cap. 1-142). \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit prologus in librum sequentem<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam de gestis beatissime virginis, Dei genetricis Marie admodum pauca in ewangelica reperiuntur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (13\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -13\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (13\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit de beata Maria virgine libellus totus ex dictis autenticis contextus. De laudibus virginis matris. Capitulum primum<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Si Deum ore prophetico iubemur in sanctis suis laudare}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ut in eternum psallat tota substancia mea. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 4001; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL Suppl. 1911}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5347e; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Ma\u238 \'eetres, 1933-1934}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 461n (=i); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Basel UB Kat. B 2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 93f. Am Rand Glossen von Schreiberhand sowie einmal (14\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Korrektur von anderer Hand, letztes Dr. 15. Jh.}

