\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 245\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -248\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Orationes ad beatam Mariam virginem}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]. \plain \f0\fs22 Sammlung von Gebeten zu den Epitheta Mariae. Invocatio: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Sancta virgo Maria, mater Dei, dignare me, laudare te et digne per omnia. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus qui venit ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 17,26)}}\plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Multifarie multisque modis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Hbr 1,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Circa cuius opera magnifica}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (248\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... feliciter contemplari Jhesum Christum, filium eius, qui cum patre et spiritu sancto vivis et regnas, Deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach (248\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -248\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnus de beata Maria virgine}}\plain \f0\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Pange lingua gloriose / Virginis preconium / Matris Dei generose}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 - ... procedenti ab utroque / Compar sit laudacio\plain \f0\fs22 . 12 Strophen nach den Epitheta Mariae\plain \f0\i\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 249\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

