\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 264\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -365\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Promptuarium exemplorum [fratrum minorum provinciae Hiberniae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Stark ver\u228 \'e4nderte Fassung (mit Prolog). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Promptuarium exemplorum seu narrationum, de quibus inter nos tractavimus quorundam fratrum instancia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in secunda parte de virtutibus et viciis ac eorum pertinenciis tractatus profusior pertrahatur. \plain \f0\fs22 (265\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Crisostomus super Matheum de stella Christi in oriente visa refert}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... auditus est unus ictus et ipse expiravit. >Expliciunt Narrationes<.\plain \f0\fs22  Danach Schreiberverse: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Actor \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 cunctorum / Placeat tibi Christo bonorum /  ... - ... Regum celorum / Rapiam velut unus eorum.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Andrew George Little (Hg.): Liber exemplorum ad usum praedicantium saeculo XIII compositus a quodam fratre minore Anglico de provincia Hiberniae. Aberdeen 1908 (ND Farnborough 1966), S. 1-126 [264\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -329\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ] (vor allem zu Beginn \u252 \'fcberaus zahlreiche Umstellungen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 2813; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mohan, Incipits, 1952}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 222. 365\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -366\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

