\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -221\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vitas patrum}}\plain \f0\fs22 ], Ausz\u252 \'fcge. (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -33\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Rufinus Aquileiensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Historia monachorum (Vitas patrum II)}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. Prolog mit erstem Blatt verloren. \plain \f0\i\fs22 ||mamus Johannem, qui vere eciam solus ... \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Eva Schulz-Fl\u252 \'fcgel (Hg.): Tyrannius Rufinus: Historia monachorum sive de vita sanctorum patrum. Berlin u.a. 1990 (Patristische Texte und Studien 34), S. 247-387. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 37-48; 90-230 (Hs auf S. 92 genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 6524. (33\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -114\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[2].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 [Verba seniorum sive] Adhortationes sanctorum patrum (Vitas patrum V-VI)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . V,4,47 sowie VI,4,22 und V,4,34 ausgelassen. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 73, Sp. 855-988; 993-1022. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 6527; 6529-6530; Columba M. Batlle: Die 'Adhortationes sanctorum patrum' ('Verba seniorum') im lateinischen Mitttelalter. M\u252 \'fcnster 1972 (Beitr\u228 \'e4ge zur Geschichte des alten M\u246 \'f6nchtums und des Benediktinerordens 31), S. 16-150. (114\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -116\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Macarius [Aegyptius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula ad filios [Dei] (Ep. 1)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 67, Sp. 1163-1166. (116\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -125\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Verba seniorum (Vitas patrum VII)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 , Exzerpte (1,1-41,1)}}\plain \f0\fs22 ]. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipiunt Excerta (!) utilia ex translacione Pascasii<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 1025-1063 (zahlreiche Auslassungen). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 6531. (125\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -128\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sophronius Eusebius] Hieronymus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Pauli Eremitae (Vitas patrum I,1)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 23, Sp. 17-30 (Abweichungen). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 6596. (128\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -149\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[4].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Athanasius Alexandrinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Antonii}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lat. von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[5].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Evagrius [Antiochenus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (Vitas patrum I,2)\plain \f0\fs22 . Mit Prolog des Evagrius. Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 125-168. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 609. (149\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -158\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Sophronius \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 Eusebius\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ] Hieronymus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[7].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Hilarionis (Vitas patrum I,3)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 23, Sp. 29-54. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 3879. (158\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -162\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[8].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Simeonis (Vitas patrum I,10)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 325-334. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 7957. (162\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Sophronius \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 Eusebius\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ] Hieronymus: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[9].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita [Sancti Malchi] monachi capitivi (Vitas patrum I,4)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 23, Sp. 55-62. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 5190. (165\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -167\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Frontonii}}\plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[10].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 (Vitas patrum I,15)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 440-442. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 3192. (167\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -168\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[11].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sanctae Marinae virginis (Vitas patrum I,24)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 691-694 (Abweichungen). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 5528. (168\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -171\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-]Athanasius [Alexandrinus]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[12].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo [exhortationis] ad monachos}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 18, Sp. 71-78 = Bd. 103, Sp. 665-672. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL Suppl. 1986}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 3192b; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 CPL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1155. (171\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -175\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[13].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sanctae Pelagiae meretricis (Vitas patrum I,22)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 663-672. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 6605. (175\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[14].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sanctorum Epicteti et Astionis (Vitas patrum I,12)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 393-414. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 2568. (186\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -194\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[15].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Abrahae (Vitas patrum I,7)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: PL, Bd. 73, Sp. 281-292; 651-660. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. BHL, Nr. 12. (194\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -198\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLIN