\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -69\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus de Sancto Theodorico}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Arnoldus Bonavallis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [et {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Godefridus Altissiodorensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita [prima] Sancti Bernardi Claraevallensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Recensio A. Buch I von Guilelmus (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -21\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ), Buch II von Arnoldus (21\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -38\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ), B\u252 \'fccher III-V von Godefridus (38\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -69\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 PL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 185, Sp. 225-366 (Abweichungen). Zu Werk und Verfasser vgl. Adriaan Hendrik Bredero: \u201 \'c9tudes sur la 'Vita prima' de Saint Bernard. In: Analecta ordinis Cisterciensis 17 (1961), S. 1-72; 215-260; 18 (1962), S. 1-59, v.a. 17 (1961), S. 21; 31 (Anm. 1); 60 (Anm. 1); 65 (Anm. 5; Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1211-1212; 1214-1216. (69\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Exempel: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Transeunte domno Claravallensi (!) abbate ipsa hora transitus eius Johannes Clarevallensis monachus equitans}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... qua ille oraverat invenit. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit liber de vita et obitu beati Bernardi abbatis Clarevallensis. Benedicatur Deus. Scriptus et completus per me Hermannum Schoeler de Erstorpp confratrem domus regularium in Insula apud\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 Valender<. Anno domini M.\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  CCCC.\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  sexagesimo primo in vigilia beati Andree apostoli\plain \f0\fs22  [29. Nov. 1461]. Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde (darunter auch Schreiberhand), letztes Dr. 15. Jh. Handwechsel.}

