\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 73\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -191\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas Cantimpratensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonum universale de apibus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  (73\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -73\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (73\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Prologus in librum, qui dicitur Bonum universale de proprietatibus apium<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendo in Christo patri fratri Humberto magistro ordinis predicatorum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (74\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Unum caput Christum in unitate ecclesie fideles habent}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... me partipicem faciat Jhesus Christus, dominus noster, qui cum patre vivit et regnat, Deus per omnia seculorum secula. Amen. >Deo gracias. \plain \f0\fs22 Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Finitus et inceptus est liber iste per me fratrem Johannem de Zegen conventualem in domo beate et gloriose virginis Marie in Insula sub Confluencia ad honorem Dei et pro peccatis meis sub anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  CCCC LXIII\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  tunc temporis dyaconum eiusdem domus<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk, Verfasser und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 3775; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1359 (Prolog); 1605 (Text). 191\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -191\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  Nachtrag von vier Exempeln, genannt u.a. Regularkanoniker in {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6923/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kirschgarten (bei Worms), CRV}}\plain \f0\fs22  (1460). 192\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer. Handwechsel.}

