\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -63\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonaventura}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Legenda maior] Sancti Francisci}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Apparuit gracia Dei salvatoris nostri diebus istis novissimis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vir erat in civitate Assisii Franciscus nomine}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (62\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... per merita servi sui Francisci ad \plain \f0\fs22 (63\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 laudem \plain \f0\fs22 (eingef\u252 \'fcgt \plain \f0\i\fs22 et\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  gloriam unius Dei, qui vivit et regnat in secula seculorum. >Deo gracias. Expliciunt miracula post transitum beati Francisci ostensa<. Finitus et inceptus per fratrem Henricum de villa Valender clericum tunc temporis domus insulane anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 CCCCLX\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  vel circa.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Adolphe Charles Peltier (Hg.): Bonaventurae opera omnia, Bd. 14. Paris 1868, S. 293-363. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen, Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge und Korrekturen, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde (darunter auch Schreiberhand), letztes Dr. 15. Jh. 63\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -64\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Bleistiftlinierung leer.}

