\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -104\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Raimundus de Capua}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita [sive Legenda maior] Sanctae Catherinae Senensis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Gek\u252 \'fcrzte Fassung. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit prefacio abbreviatoris in vitam minorem Sancte Katherine de Senis virginis<.\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ego frater Raimundus de Capua ordinis fratrum predicatorum, humilis magister generalis et servus, decrevi ex mirabilibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ne in ulla re veritatem offendam. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Fuit in anno domini milesimo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 tricentesimo }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 quadragesimo septimo in civitate Senensi vir unus nomine Jacobus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... nos similiter faciendo ad ipsam in regnum Cristi sublevari mereamur. >Et sic est finis historie minoris sancte virginis Katherine de Senis anno [1]481<\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AASS}}\plain \f0\fs22 , April III, S. 859-905 (K\u252 \'fcrzungen und Abweichungen). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1702 (Abweichungen); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 3419 (Abweichungen). Am Rand Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberh\u228 \'e4nden sowie weiteren H\u228 \'e4nden, letztes V. 15. Jh. 105\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -106\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

