\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 126\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -144\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Gobelinus Person}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Meinulphi}}\plain \f0\fs22 . (126\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -136\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Vita: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Prologus in vitam \plain \f0\fs22 (gestrichen \plain \f0\i\fs22 Sancti\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  Maynulphi dyaconi et confessoris post ceteros novissime collectam et editam per venerabilem dominum Gobelinum Persoen decanum Bijlveldiensem<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Dum super flumina Babilonis Paderfontane sedimus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ad hac vita temporali per tempora longiora differret. >Explicit Vita<.\plain \f0\fs22  (136\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -144\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Translatio: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Hic sequitur Processus translacionis et reformacionis monasterii Budecensis<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Dum in concilio vigilum celestium iam decretum fuerat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... largiri dignetur, qui cum Deo patre in unitate spiritus sancti vivit et regnat, Deus per omnia secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AASS}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Okt. III, S. 216-224 (Vita); Max Jansen: Cosmidromius Gobelini Person und als Anhang desselben Verfassers: Processus translationis et reformationis monasterii Budecensis. M\u252 \'fcnster 1900, S. 231-243 (Translatio). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. VII-LVI (Hs. auf S. LVI genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5883 (Vita); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 7, Sp. 413f. Abschrift von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Erpernburg, Archiv Brenken, Hs. 86}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 18\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -32\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (B\u246 \'f6ddeken, CRV, M. 15. Jh.), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Vry, Liborius, 1997}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 236. Am Rand Glossen, Korrekturen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberhand sowie weiteren H\u228 \'e4nden, letzte V. 15. Jh. 145\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -151\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

