\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 152\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -155\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Aurelius Augustinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula de vita Sanctae Monicae ad Perpetuam sororem}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Vita Sancte Monice matris sancti patris nostri Augustini episcopi tracta ex nono Confessionum et ex duabus epistolis, quas idem sanctus pater noster Augustinus scripsit sorori sue nomine Perpetua virgini preposite seu priorisse monialium<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Hortor te, inquit, dilecta sponsa Christi, ut Deo studeas in omnibus placere}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sepultum fuerit in novissimo die. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AASS}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Mai I, S. 480f. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5999. Abschrift von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Erpernburg, Archiv Brenken, Hs. 86}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 44\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -47\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  (B\u246 \'f6ddeken, CRV, M. 15. Jh.), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Vry, Liborius, 1997}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 236.}

