\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 155\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Franciscus Petrarca}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Historia Griseldis (Sen. XVII 3)}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Fassung d. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Epistola domini Francisci Petrache \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ad dominum Johannem Bocacium de Certaldo Florentinum poetam de historia Griseldis mulieris maxime paciencie atque constancie<. \plain \f0\fs22 (155\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -156\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Librum tuum, quem nostro materno eloquio}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (156\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Est autem ad Ytalie latus occiduum Vesalus unus ex Appenini iugis mons altissimus et qui vertice nubila superans}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (165\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... quod pro suo \plain \f0\fs22 (165\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 mortali coniuge rusticana hec muliercula passa est.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Ursula Hess: Heinrich Steinh\u246 \'f6wels 'Griseldis'. Studien zur Text- und \u220 \'dcberlieferungsgeschichte einer fr\u252 \'fchhumanistischen Prosanovelle. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1975 (MTU 43), S. 173-238; Jonathan Burke Severs: The literary relationship of Chaucer's Clerkes Tale. New Haven 1942 (Yale Studies in English 96), S. 254-292. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 42-58. Abschrift von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Erpernburg, Archiv Brenken, Hs. 86}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 47\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -56\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (B\u246 \'f6ddeken, CRV, M. 15. Jh.), vgl. Vry, Liborius, 1997, S. 236. 166\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -175\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

