\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 176\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -182\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita Sancti Gualterii}}\plain \f0\fs22 . (176\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -180\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Vita: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipit prologus in vitam beati Walteri abbatis et confessoris. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Divine laudis materiam ac exultacionis causam prebet ordini monastico dies presens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Operante hec ad gloriam sancti sui domino nostro Jhesu Christo, cui cum patre et sancto spiritu honor et gloria in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  (180\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -182\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Miracula. Sammlung von acht Mirakeln. Ohne Prolog. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Post gloriosam igitur corporis sui deposicionem cepit locus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 - ... ad suam regressa est mansionem. Expliciunt Miracula Sancti Walteri. Tercia die Mai est dies Sancti Walteri.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AASS}}\plain \f0\fs22 , April I, S. 754-757 (Vita); 763f. (Miracula). Zum Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 8798 (Vita); 8797 (Miracula). 182\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  und 183\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -186\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  [Nachsatz] leer.}

