\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [VE]. - {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22 , eine Hand \u183 \'b7 Rote und blaue Rubrizierung \u183 \'b7 Eine rot-blaue (9\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) sowie 23 rote und blaue, teilweise auch mauvefarbige und goldene {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Initialen mit Aussparungen und Knospenfleuronn\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f0\fs22  (5\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 55\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 75\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 119\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 133\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 145\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 156\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 . 165\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 . 191\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 197\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 202\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 223\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 236\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 241\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 246\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 254\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 255\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 . 261\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 . 279\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 287\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 . 291\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 . 291\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 . 292\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ; Stil Arnheim, 3. V. 15. Jh., vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Korteweg, Kriezels, 1992}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 131; 135-137 (Nr. 124-126)) \u183 \'b7 I\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  [Vorsatz] Besitzvermerk: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Liber magistri et domini Philippi Schoen doctoris in medicinis et canonici ecclesie Sancti Victoris Xanctensis\plain \f0\fs22 , 1470/1490 \u183 \'b7 Ab Bl 9