\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - 2 V\plain \f0\super\fs28 20\plain \f0\fs22  + 8 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 116\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 126\plain \f0\fs22  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 138\plain \f0\fs22  + (II+3)\plain \f0\super\fs28 145\plain \f0\fs22  + 5 V\plain \f0\super\fs28 195\plain \f0\fs22  + (IV+1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 204\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 214\plain \f0\fs22 . Teilweise Lagensignaturen (I-III, separat) und Reklamanten (II-IV, separat) \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum 19,5 \u215 \'d7 14,5 (I-II); 19,5 \u215 \'d7 14 (III); 20 \u215 \'d7 14,5 (IV) \u183 \'b7 2 Sp. \u183 \'b7 44-45 Z. (I); 39-41 Z. (II); 39-40 Z. (III); 39-47 Z. (IV) \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gotico-Humanistica}}\plain \f0\fs22  (I, IV), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22  (II) und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[2]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rotunda}}\plain \f0\fs22  (III-IV), sechs H\u228 \'e4nde \u183 \'b7 Rubrizierung; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Lombarden teilweise mit Aussparungen  mauvefarbigem Knospenfleuronn\u233 \'e9e}}\plain \f0\fs22  (I-III, \u252 \'fcbergreifend; Stil Arnheim, 1440/1460, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Korteweg, Kriezels, 1992}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 135f. (Nr. 124-125); Bonn, ULB, S 478: Arnheim, um 1470) \u183 \'b7 Ein {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schema}}\plain \f0\fs22  (20\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 III\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  [ehemaliger Spiegel VD] Besitzvermerk: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Liber magistri et domini Philippi Schoen doctoris in medicinis et canonici ecclesie Sancti Victoris Xanctensis\plain \f0\fs22 , E. 15. Jh.}

