\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -20\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 [Johannes] Michael Savonarola}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De urinis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Urina est aquositas superflua in venis epatis}}\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... - ... deinde ab odore et colore, ultimo a quantitate. Completus est tractatus de urinis divina favente gracia a famosissimo ac preclarissimo arcium ac medicine doctore magistro Michaele Savonarolla \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Pattavo\plain \f0\fs22  (!), \plain \f0\i\fs22 pro quo et ceteris Jesu misericordi genitricique sue gloriose ac beato Yeronimo gracias agit infinitas. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Danach Schema zu den \plain \f0\i\fs22 Colores significantes\plain \f0\fs22 . Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1607; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BAMAT}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 7,  Nr. 3996. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand sowie einer weiteren Hand, Humanistica, letztes Dr. 15. Jh. (Philippus Schoen?). }

