\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 77\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -138\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Antonius Guainerius}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De peste et de venenis}}\plain \f0\fs22 . (78\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -121\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) De peste. (77\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Persepe animadvertens hoc mortale hominum genus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Mit Nennung von Antonius Guainerius. (77\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -78\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (78\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum aliquem pestis rapit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et aliis variolarum vestigia removentibus. Et hic est finis, tu \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 re \plain \f0\fs22 (!) [i.e. \plain \f0\i\fs22 cure\plain \f0\fs22 ] \plain \f0\i\fs22 morbillorum, per quam huius tractatus prime principali parti finis imponitur ad laudem et gloriam Jhesu crucifixi, eius genitricis alme tociusque celestis curie triumphantis. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1036 (Prolog); 280 (Text). (122\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -138\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) De venenis. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipit 3\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 a\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 pars principalis huius tractatus materiam continens venenorum ...\plain \f0\fs22  (122\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -122\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (122\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Etsi venenum multipliciter accipi possit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ac suam procurare complexionem facere tyracalem. Et hoc de modo faciendi complexiones tyracales. >Laus Deo<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963, Sp. 529. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen, eine Hand, Humanistica und Hybrida, letztes Dr. 15. Jh. (Philippus Schoen?). 138\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -155\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  bis auf Schriftspiegellinierung leer.}

