\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 156\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -172\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Bartholomaeus de Montagnana}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consilia}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Ausz\u252 \'fcge (Cons. 10; 19; 139; 80). In den Kolophonen Verfasserzuschreibungen und Textdatierungen (Padua 1432-1433). (156\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -162\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Cons. 10: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Adolescens quidam de civitate Vincentina famosa satis disposicione}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (162\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Cons. 19: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Diligenter examinatis omnibus, que per informacionem ex sermone}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (166\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -170\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Cons. 139: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vir insignis Baptista Anthonianus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (170\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -171\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Cons. 80: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Eximius legum doctor dominus Guilelmus de Colalto habet dispositionem epatis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ..\plain \f0\fs22 . (171\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -172\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vir generosus et reverendus pater dominus prior Sancti Anthonii}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Bartholomaeus Montagnana: Selectorum operum ... liber unus et alter. Frankfurt 1604, S. 51-61 (Cons. 10); 154-159 (Cons. 19); 605-613 (Cons. 139); Opera. Venetiis 1499, 112\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  (Cons. 80).}

