\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -97\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Codex [medicus Coloniensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Kompilation verschiedener Krankheitslehren (Dist. I-X). Fragment am Ende. Prolog (Inhaltsverzeichnis): \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Codex iste i[n] x particulis inscriptus<, ut enim sciat quilibet et quibus in locis querenda requirant}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ....\plain \f0\fs22  (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -12\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. I (De pathologia): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum inter omnia animalia homo racionabilis creatura}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (12\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -20\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. II (De febribus et spasmo): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sciendum est quod ex nimia ciborum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (20\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -30\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. III (De confectionibus et herbis): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Opium sic fit: Mense Julio papaveris folia virida collige}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (30\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -45\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. IV (De diaetis, prognosticis et de infirmitatibus animalium): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Mense Januario mane bibas vinum optimum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (45\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -52\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. V (De sanitate capitis): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Pillule cochie prosunt capiti}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (52\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -62\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. VI (De doloribus capitis): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Tinnitus aurium qui paciuntur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (62\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -71\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. VII (De dolore ventris etc.): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Si quis de pocione ultra modum solutus fuerit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (71\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -82\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. VIII (De ulceribus etc.): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[8].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad ulcera in capite in quolibet loco}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (82\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -91\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. IX (De vulneribus etc.): (82\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[9].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 De vi betonice ad curandum capitis fracturam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (91\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -97\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Dist. X (De cancro etc.): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[10].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Accipe sucum radicis lilii}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... si non puella ||\plain \f0\fs22  Text bricht ab. Zu einzelnen Teilen des Werks vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 311 (Dist. I); 1393 (Dist. II); 867 (Dist. IV); 609 (Dist. IX). Am Rand (48\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 73\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 77\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) sowie auf zwei Schaltzetteln (s.o.) vereinzelt Glossen und Rezepte, eine Hand, Anf. 16. Jh.}

