\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 308\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -311\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Coluccio Salutati}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula ad [Jodocum de Moravia] regem Romanorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel (Nachtrag von Kalteisen (?)): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Littera cancellarii Florentini ad regem Romanorum.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Nichil totius mortalitatis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 mee vite curriculo quamvis iam sexagesimum et sextum annum attingerim}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... que sic me inspirare voluit et iudicare. Vale Florentie XIII Kalendas Septembris. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Francesco Novati (Hg.): Epistolario di Coluccio Salutati. Rom 1896, Bd. 3, S. 198-218 (dat. 20. Aug. 1397).}

