\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 312\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -318\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula] universitatis Oxoniensis [de scismate] ad Richardum regem Angliae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 Titel (Nachtrag von Kalteisen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Littera studii Oxoniensis ad regem Anglie.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Christianissimo principi et domino suo Richardo Dei gracia regis Anglie ... universitas studii generalis Mazonie }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (verbessert in }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Oxonie}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 )}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  unitatis et pacis animatrix ... Illustrissime principum amantissime ac serenissime, super lugubri scissura per quam navicula Petri pene per medium laceratur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in concordia catholice universitatis. Datum in congregacione nostra apud ecclesiam beate virginis Oxonie de consensu regencium et non regencium et hora specialiter celebrata XVII die Martii anno domini M\u176 \'b0CCC\u176 \'b0nonagesimo quinto \plain \f0\fs22 [17. M\u228 \'e4rz 1395] \plain \f0\i\fs22 etc.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Gilbert Ouy: Gerson et l'Angleterre. In: Anthony Levi: Humanism in France at the end of the Middle Ages and in the early Renaissance. Manchester 1970, S. 43-81, hier: S. 56-73. Vereinzelt Glossen von Kalteisen und weiterer Hand, 1. Dr. 15. Jh. (316\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) nicht beschrieben (dazu Vermerk von Kalteisen). 319\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

