\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 345\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -346\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Dux Bituricensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula ad] Innocentium VII. Papam}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titeladresse: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Fama et nomine viro glorioso domino Cosmacio, quem Romani et alii plures Innocencium septimum vocant<. \plain \f0\fs22 Am Rand erg\u228 \'e4nzt von Kalteisen: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Regis Francorum. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Homo Dei, si pacem queris ecclesie sicud }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 velox aput }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 multos fama iam percrebuit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... si placet non mutata substantia latius declarabit. Scriptum Parisiis XXVIII die Januarii. >Sancte Romane ecclesie fidelis et devotus Johannes quondam regis Francorum filius dux Bituricensis et Alvergnie, Pictavie, Bononie, Stamparum et Alvergnie comes<. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Edmond Mart\u232 \'e8ne (Hg.): Veterum scriptorum et monumentorum historicorum, dogmaticorum, moralium amplissima collectio, Bd. 7. Paris 1733, Sp. 695-702 (dat. 1405). Handwechsel.}

