\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 347\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermones synodales}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von drei Konzeptfassungen \u252 \'fcber das gleiche Thema. Nr. 1 (374\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Voca operarios ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Mt 20,8)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Reverendissimi et domini mei, qui respicit vias hominis et omnes gressus illius}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 2 (374\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Exeant ad miliciam, quos labor vocat}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Nr. 3 (374\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ex quibus quidem verbis in brevi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Am Rand Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen, eine Hand, Anf. 15. Jh. (u.a. Erw\u228 \'e4hnung von Papst Innocenz VII.).}

