\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 354\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 . 361\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -366\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Elzearius de Sabrano}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De facto scismatis [sive De electione Urbani VI. Papae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]. \plain \f0\fs22 Titel (Nachtrag von Kalteisen): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Cardinalis Theatini de scismate\plain \f0\fs22 ; vgl. dazu von gleicher Hand (361\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Cardinalis Theatini super facto scismatis.\plain \f0\fs22  (354\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Actum collegio ex narratione cuiusdam scripture presumptuose per certos cardinales contra dominum nostrum papam, in qua asserunt ipsum non esse papam, et certas causas allegant tam in facto quam in iure. Casus ergo secundum eorum narrationem talis est. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Asserunt namque cardinales prefati, quod, dum ipsi intraverunt conclave ad electionem canonicam celebrandam, officiales urbis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... tanta arrogantia et tam gravi mendacio negant in terris vicarium Jhesu Christi. >Explicit suprascriptum domini cardinalis Theatini<.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Souchon, Papstwahlen (1889-1889)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 270 (Nr. 195); S. 307 (Anm. 195; Hs genannt). Kollektive Abschrift des Hauptschreibers und der bereits oben (347\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -353\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) t\u228 \'e4tigen Hand (auch 354\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 365\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). Am Rand Glossen und Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen von Schreiberhand und Kalteisen. Handwechsel (zu 367\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

