6ln, Kunibert-Meister"}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 1135/1440, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Legner, Ornamenta ecclesiae, 1985}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 258; 260 (Nr. E 49; Abb.); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Rhein und Maas, 1973}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 305-332, hier: S. 322; 324 (m. Abb. 33); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[6].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 B SB Illum. 1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 27-29 (Abb. 24-27): "Gladbach, um 1140"; 74 (Abb. 163): "Maria Laach, 2. V. 12. Jh."; 147f. (Abb. 359-363): "Werden, vor 1159").}

