\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -39\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes] Guallensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Breviloquium philosophorum [de virtutibus antiquorum principum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Breviloquium philosophorum et est prima pars Gallensis<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam misericordia et veritas custodiunt regem ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Prv 20,28)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Quatuor virtutes cardinales, scilicet prudencia, temperancia, fortitudo et iusticia}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... \plain \f0\fs22 (39\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  ubi vis manere, ego sum vita, ad quam perducat eternus Deus. Amen. >Explicit Liber de quatuor virtutibus cardinalibus seu Breviloquium philosophorum. Sequitur Tabula<.\plain \f0\fs22  (39\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Ma\u238 \'eetres, 1933-1934}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 115 (Nr. 322b); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 4971; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mohan, Initia, 1975-1978}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 364; Jenny Swanson: John of Wales. A study of the works and ideas of a thirteenth-century friar. Cambridge 1989 (Cambridge studies in medieval life and thought IV,10), S. 41-62; 229-290. Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen und Glossen von drei H\u228 \'e4nden (darunter auch der Schreiberhand), letztes Dr. 15. Jh.}

