\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 40\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -94\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-]Cyrillus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Boniohannes de Messina}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Speculum sapientiae [sive] Quadriparitus apologeticus [figurarum moralium]}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Quadripartitus apologiticus \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Cyrilli episcopi<. \plain \f0\fs22 Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Secundum Aristotilis }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!) }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 sententiam in probleumatibus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  suis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (40\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vulpes decrepita ardens cupiditate}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (92\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... Et hiis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 dictis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 quievit. >Explicit Quadriparitus apologiticus \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 beati Cirilli episcopi, in quo quidem speculo limpidissimo omnis sapiencia claret in laudem eterni Dei. Sequuntur registra huius operis et primo libri primi<. \plain \f0\fs22 (92\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -94\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gr\u228 \'e4sse, Die beiden \u228 \'e4ltesten lat. Fabelb\u252 \'fccher des Mittelalters, 1880}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 3-118. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5372; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 699; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre, Catalogue of Incipits, 1963}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Sp. 1418;\plain \f0\b\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 Remigio Sabbadini: Il 'Quadripartitus' di Bongiovanni da Messina. In: Giornale Storico della Letteratura Italiana 90 (1927), S. 216-219; Ulrike Bodemann: Die Cyrillusfabeln und ihre deutsche \u220 \'dcbersetzung durch Ulrich von Pottenstein. M\u252 \'fcnchen 1988 (MTU 93), S. 50-52 (Hs auf S. 50 genannt). Vielleicht Vorlage f\u252 \'fcr {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bonn, ULB, S 313}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -113\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  (Niederwerth, CRV, 1471). Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen und Glossen von drei H\u228 \'e4nden (darunter auch der Schreiberhand), letztes Dr. 15. Jh.}

