\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 148\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -238\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sinte Katherinen van Senis Leven}}\plain \f0\fs22 , brabantisch mit fl\u228 \'e4mischen Einsprengseln\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Ndl. \u220 \'dcbersetzung von {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Raimundus de Capua}}\plain \f0\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Legenda maior Catherinae Senensis}}\plain \f0\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1702). \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Hier beghint tsinte Katherinen van Senis Leven<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Het was een man in een stede gheheeten Senis des conincrijcs van Tuscaven, die Jacob hiet}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... den loep haers levens, die binaest al vol was van miraculen ende boven nature, die mach men hier claerlijcke merken. Amen. God sij gheloest \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  altoest. >Ghescreven int jaer ons heeren dusent vijf hondert ende sevenne op onser liever vrouwen assumptie avont\plain \f0\fs22  [14. Aug. 1507]\plain \f0\i\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Axters, Bibliotheca Dominicana Neerlandica, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 178f. (Hs genannt).}

