\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 I\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Astronomische und theologische Versus (Exzerpte). I\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -18\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Cessolis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Libellus de moribus hominum et de officiis nobilium super ludo scaccorum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipit Prologus in librum compositum super ludo scakorum de moribus hominum et officiis nobilium\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Multorum fratrum ordinis nostri et divisorum scolarium precibus persuasus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Inter omnia mala signa in homine unum est}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (18\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... possumus cum eo vivere et regnare. Hunc autem libellum ... ego frater Jacobus de Cetulis \plain \f0\fs22 (!) (18\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ordinis\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 fratrum predicatorum composui ... a quo descendit omne datum optimum et perfectum. Deo igitur sit honor et gloria in secula seculorum. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 Danach Versus ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 10459) und Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Completus in [Sl]edehusen\plain \f0\fs22  [Schledehausen bei Osnabr\u252 \'fcck] \plain \f0\i\fs22 anno domini M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 IX\plain \f0\fs22  [1409]. Ed.: Ernst K\u246 \'f6pke: Jacobus de Cessolis. In: Mitteilungen aus den Handschriften der Ritter-Akademie zu Brandenburg a. d. Havel 2 (1879), S. 1-36 (Abweichungen). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 2066. Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde (darunter auch Schreiberhand), Anf. 15. Jh.; letztes V. 15. Jh. Handwechsel.}

