\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 104\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -304\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas [Ringstedus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Lectura] super Proverbia}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipit Postilla super Proverbia Salomonis a fratre Thoma Anglico ordinis fratrum predicatorum conpilata< \plain \f0\fs22 (!). Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 In absconditis parabolarum conversabitur {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ecl 39,3). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Iocundissimus, ut ait Policraticus}}\plain \f0\fs22  ... (105\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Parabole Salomonis ... Circa principium huius libri est advertendum}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (301\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... Qui postea ex parte \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  natus filios Dei congregavit in unum. Amen. Deo gracias\plain \f0\fs22 . (302\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -304\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Register A-M von einer der Schreiberh\u228 \'e4nde; Fragment durch Blattverlust (s.o.). Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 8172; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 3845 (Hs jeweils genannt). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde, 15.-16. Jh.}

