\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 6\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -13\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Henricus Kalteisen}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Tractatus] de nomine Jesu}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 De nomine Jhesu. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sciendum, ut dicit Huguicio in suis derivacionibus }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 [Huguitius: Lexicon etymologicum sive Liber derivationum]}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17  et Catholicon libro 4\u176 \'b0 littera 9: Hoc nomen Jh[esu]s tribus litteris scribitur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Et in futuro in gloria ostende nobis fruenter. Benedictum fructum ventris tui Jh[esu]m, Jhesum, Jh[esu]m, Jhesum, Jh[esu]m. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 8\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 /9\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Wechsel im Schriftduktus. Am Rand Glossen von Kalteisen und der Nachtragshand (vgl. 13\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -15\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 , wohl ebenfalls Kalteisen).}

