\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -65\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Guilelmus Durantis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?)\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Confessionale sive] Memoriale aureum confessorum et sacerdotum}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Incipit Aureum confessorum memoriale et sacerdotum. \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum sit ars arcium regimen animarum ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (X. 1.14.14)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Cum sit. Ignominosum fore valde convincitur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et sic intelligo extra 'De accusacionibus accusasti' \plain \f0\fs22 (X. 5.1.8),\plain \f0\i\fs22  'De hiis qui filies' \plain \f0\fs22 (X. 5.10), \plain \f0\i\fs22 'De spon[salibus]' Di[gest]a li. xxii \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  q. 5 c. 1. \plain \f0\fs22 Nicht identisch mit Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979, Nr. 1235 (Johannes de Ehenheim: Aureum confessorum). Zum Verfasser vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Krakau BJ Kat. 1}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 460 (Duranti). Gleiche Fassung wie {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Aschaffenburg, StiftsB, Ms. Pap. 17, 369}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 ra}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -378}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 vb}}\plain \f0\fs22  (E. 14. Jh.), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AB StiftsB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 121f. Am Rand vereinzelt Korrekturen von Schreiberhand sowie Glossen von anderer Hand, E. 15. Jh. (Kalteisen?). Handwechsel.}

