\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -4\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Epistula ambasiatorum concilii Basiliensis ad concilium de consensione [Amadei VIII.] ducis Sabaudiae in electionem papatus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 18. Dez. 1439. Titel: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Epistola ambasiatorum concilii ad concilium de eo, quod dux Sabaudie \plain \f0\fs22 [Felix V. Antipapa] \plain \f0\i\fs22 consensit in eleccionem papatus<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Reverendissimis in Christo patribus ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendissimi patres et prestantissimi domini post humilem et devotam recommendacionem. Pauca in sermone sed grandia in opere}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et conservare dignetur. Datum Thononi \plain \f0\fs22 [Thonon-les-Bains/Genfer See]\plain \f0\i\fs22  Gebenensis dyocesis xviii die mensis Decembris anno domini M\u176 \'b0 cccc\u176 \'b0 xxxix. \plain \f0\fs22 Erg\u228 \'e4nzung von Schreiberhand (Promulgationsvermerk): \plain \f0\i\fs22 Hodie terra horam decimam ... ut signa gaudii et leticia fiant sicut tantarum rerum iocunditas exposcit.}

