\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 47\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -112\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Determinationes universitatum Wiennensis, Coloniensis, Erfordensis et Cracoviensis contra Eugenium IV. Papam pro stabilimento concilii Basiliensis et approbatione Felicis V. papae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . 1441. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Incipiunt Determinaciones quatuor \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 universitatum Germanie pro stabilimento sacrosancti Basiliensis concilii et approbacione sanctissimi domini Felicis Papae V. et iusta dampnacione olim Eugenii<.\plain \f0\fs22  (47\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -55\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Wien: (47\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa materiam unionis, quam inierunt reverendissimi patres et illustrissimi principes, sacri Romani imperii electores, ut dicitur una cum aliis principibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... in quo et ipsi noscuntur Christum ducem ymitari.\plain \f0\fs22  (55\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -59\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) K\u246 \'f6ln: (56\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ad requestam reverendissimi in Christo patris et domini domini Theoderici archiepiscopi Coloniensis ... >Proposicio prima<. Ecclesia synodaliter congregata}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... super malicia hominum ad salutem Christi fidelium et gloriam sui nominis in seculorum secula benedicti. Amen. \plain \f0\fs22 (59\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -69\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Erfurt: \plain \f0\i\fs22 In nomine spiritus sancti paracliti. Amen. Reverendissimo  ... Theoderico Dei gracia sancte Maguntine sedis ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendissimo ... Theoderico Dei gracia sancte Maguntine sedis ... Nedum per organum venerabilis magistri Henrici Leubynck}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... quam ipsis et nobis et omni populo christiano Christus ipse pacis auctor concedat, qui cum patre et spiritu perpetue vivit et regnat. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  (69\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -112\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Krakau: (70\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 Reverendissimo in Christo patri domino Sbigneo episcopo Crakoviensi ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Deliberantibus nobis, quid super instanti requisicione}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... tenet universalis ecclesia, in qua error subesse non potest. Amen. Scriptum et finitum M\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o \plain \f0\i\fs22 cccc\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o \plain \f0\i\fs22 xli. >Expliciunt septem conclusiones alme universitatis Cracoviensis ... de auctoritate concilii Basiliensis et dampnacione olim Eugenii et eleccione sanctissimi domini Felicis pape et de neutralitate<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Caesar Egassius Bulaeus: Historia universitatis Parisiensis, Bd. 5. Paris 1670 (ND Frankfurt/Main 1966), S. 471-479 [Wien]; 460-462 [K\u246 \'f6ln]; 462-471 [Erfurt]; 479-517 [Krakau]. Am Rand Glossen und Streichungen von Schreiberhand sowie vom Rubrikator.}

