\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 113\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -120\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ludovicus [Pontanus]}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Sermo exhortatorius [ad Theodericum archiepiscopum] Coloniensem}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  16.-20. Aug. 1438. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Ludowicus de Roma prothonotarius sedis apostolice et orator sacri concilii Basiliensis coram domino Coloniensi \plain \f0\fs22 [Ebf. Dietrich II. von K\u246 \'f6ln, reg. 1414-1463, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Gams, Series episcoporum, 1973}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 270] \plain \f0\i\fs22 proposuit<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Reverendissime pater et princeps illustrissime. Sancta catholica ecclesia apud sanctam Basiliensem synodum representata legittime}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... redeat ad salutem cum obedire ceperit monitis presidentis. Amen. >Explicit Sermo exhortatorius egregii domini et magistri Ludowici de alma et inclita urbe Roma ... coram domino Coloniensi oratore<. \plain \f0\fs22 \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Krakau, BJ, cod. 420}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 119\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -124\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 , vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Krakau BJ Kat. 2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 258. Am Rand Glossen und Streichungen von Schreiberhand sowie vom Rubrikator.}

