\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -96\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Lob der heiligen Dreifaltigkeit}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von Lobpsalmen auf Gottvater, Jesus, Maria und den Heiligen Geist. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Hyr begint eyn suverlick loff van der gloriozen hilligen drevoldicheit. Hir bidde wy gode und begeren, dat he uns verliene und geve gracie em otmodelike to laven [und to] verheven mit stediger andacht und vuricheit des herten<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 O schep[p]er [al]re creatueren, hertich und orsprongelicke fonteine ... ick presenter dinre hogher maiesteit}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... Ick bidde dy, lieve here, wilt doch mi armen sundigen menscen\plain \f0\fs22  (danach Platz freigelassen) \plain \f0\i\fs22 unde allen N. genedich und barmhertich sin. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand Korrekturen und Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von Schreiberhand sowie anderen H\u228 \'e4nden, 1510/1530. Handwechsel.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

\uc1
\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 97\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -107\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Gr\u252 \'fcndonnerstagsandacht}}\plain \f0\fs22 .\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Hyr begynt de honychvloenden worde, de unse lieve here spack \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 in den avent<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Voer den festdagen van paschen, wante Jesus wuste, dat syn verquam, dat he gaen solde van desser werlt to dem vader}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... up dat de myne, dar du my medde mynest, in em sy und ick in em.\plain \f0\fs22  Handwechsel.}

{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg0\uc1\deff0\deflang0\deflangfe0{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset1 Arial;}}{\colortbl;\red0\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;\red0\green255\blue255;\red0\green255\blue0;\red255\green0\blue255;\red255\green0\blue0;\red255\green255\blue0;\red255\green255\blue255;\red0\green0\blue128;\red0\green128\blue128;\red0\green128\blue0;\red128\green0\blue128;\red128\green0\blue0;\red128\green128\blue0;\red128\green128\blue128;\red192\green192\blue192;\red204\green238\blue221;}

