\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 48\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -52\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [Pseudo-{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Rigaldi}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Formula] confessionis ('Cum ad sacerdotem')}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum ad sacerdotem peccator accesserit pro peccatis confitendis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... sacramentis ecclesie autoritate Dei et mei misterii \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 veri commissi in nomine patris et filii et spiritui sancti.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: Joseph Goering / Pierre J. Payer: The 'Summa penitentiae Fratrum Predicatorum'. A Thirteenth-Century Confessional Formulary. In: Mediaeval Studies 55 (1993), S. 1-50, hier: S. 25-41 (am Ende Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen). Zu Verfasser (anonym), Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. ebd., S. 1-22; 41-50; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1032; Am\u233 \'e9d\u233 \'e9e Teetaert: La 'Formula Confessionum' du Fr\u232 \'e8re Mineur Jean Rigaud (+1361). In: Miscellanea historica in honorem Alberti de Meyer. Leuven u.a. 1946 (Recueil de travaux d'histoire et de philologie 3,23), Bd. 2, S. 651-676, hier: S. 674-676. 52\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen, darunter (52\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) zwei Versus ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1546; 3214).}

