\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 220\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -234\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Castellanus Nicolai de Bunarellis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Apparatus arboris syllogisticae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quid sine te loquor, o veritas, vel quid sine te intelligere potero}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... mihi Constellano \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f0\i\fs22  quondam Nicolai de Bunarellis nunc actu legentis iura ordinaria civilia in studio Perusino ... \plain \f0\fs22 Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam affirmantis vel negantis fore iuridicum non est}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et remotis viciis utilitatem suam durando asservet. Sit igitur laus, honor, gloria domino nostro Jhesu Christo eiusque matri virgini gloriose et omnibus sanctis per infinita secula. Explicit Apparatus arboris sillogistice per dominum Castellanum \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f0\i\fs22 quondam domini Nicolai de Bunarellis de Bononia legum doctorem actu legentem in studio Perusino anno domini M ccc \plain \f0\fs22 (verbessert aus \plain \f0\i\fs22 cccc\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  xl mensis Marcii.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Verfasser und Werk vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 CALMA}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 579 (Lit.). 235\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

