\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 236\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -240\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Andreae}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 :] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Lectura super arboribus consanguinitatis et affinitatis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa lecturam arboris diversis olim diversum modum tenentibus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... et precipue studentes continue perseverent per graciam eius, qui est benedictus in secula seculorum. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Friedberg, Corpus iuris canonici, 1879}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, Sp. 1425-1436. Zu Verfasser, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schulte, Geschichte, 1875}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 214-216; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Coing, Handbuch, 1973}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 1, S. 379. 241\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

