\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -241\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes Petrus de Ferrariis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Practica [nova iudicialis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam vita< brevis ac incerta, qua fruimur}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum iure cautum sit, quod agere intendens}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (240\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... ex l. 'Imperatoris' ff. 'De appellatione' cum symilibus etc. DEO GRACIAS. Explicit Practica famosissimi doctoris domini Johannis Petri de Ferrariis, civis inclite civitatis Papie. Scriptum ad instantiam venerabilis ac eximii sacrorum scilicet canonum scolaris domini Gherardi Nyenensis prepositi beate Marie Resensis. Completum sub anno domini M.CCCC\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 .XLVIII\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22 . in die beate Prisce virginis et martiris \plain \f0\fs22 [18. Jan. 1448] \plain \f0\i\fs22 per me Ruthgerum Breeu de Lanckbroeck.\plain \f0\fs22  (241\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Texterg\u228 \'e4nzung: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Postremo, quod offensiones cotidie ... et ibi videas etc.\plain \f0\fs22  (241\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -241\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. Zu Autor, Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schulte, Geschichte}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 2, S. 294 (Hs in Anm. 1 genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Dolezalek, Verzeichnis, 1972}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 3, s.v. 'Johannes Petrus de Ferrariis'. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 W\u252 \'fcrzburg, UB, M. ch. f. 8, 3}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 r}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 -285}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\super\fs28\chcbpat17 v}}\plain \f0\fs22  (Italien, Abschrift f\u252 \'fcr den deutschen Juristen Johannes He\u223 \'dfler, Rektor der Universit\u228 \'e4t Pavia, kurz vor 1450; sehr \u228 \'e4hnliche Wzz und Reklamanten), vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 W\u220 \'dc UB Kat. 3.2}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 7f. Am Rand vereinzelt Erg\u228 \'e4nzungen und Glossen von Schreiberhand sowie eine weitere, gleichzeitige Hand (Gerardus Nyenhuys?), M. 15. Jh.}

