\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 7\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -14\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -6\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus XII. Papa}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Constitutiones de beneficiis curiae Romanae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Sammlung von 19 Konstitutionen, Renovationen, Determinationen und Modifikationen (Avignon 1335-1341). Nr. 1 (7\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -9\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): Constitutio de procuratoribus sive moderationibus visitantium. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Vas eleccionis Paulus apostolus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (18. Dez. 1336). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Mansi, Collectio, 1960-1962}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 25 (1782), S. 987-992 (Nr. II); Nr. 2 (9\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) Renovatio decimarum per universum mundum. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Ex cotidiana instancia nobis licet immeritis superare}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (18. Dez. 1336); Nr. 3 (9\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -10\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Determinatio quaestionis de beata visione faciali. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Benedictus Deus in donis suis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (20. Jan. 1336). Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Magnum Bullarium Romanum}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 3,2, S. 213f. (Nr. V); Mansi (s.o.), Bd. 25 (1782), S. 985-987 (Nr. I); Nr. 4 (10\plain \f0\super