\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -200\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Consuetudines ordinis Cartusiensium}}\plain \f0\fs22 , lat. mit moselfrk. Einsch\u252 \'fcben. Genereller Teil (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) mit Erweiterungen f\u252 \'fcr den Trierer Konvent (55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -93\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Prolog: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sciendum quod quamvis omnia non equaliter in omnibus domibus ordinis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (2\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Consuetudines [generales] ordinis Cartusiensium\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sacrista antequam pro matutinis faciat dua signa}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... a patribus inductus totaliter inmutabitur.\plain \f0\fs22  (55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -93\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Consuetudines [speciales] domus Cartusiae Sancti Albani prope Treverim. 1419-1487. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Sicut habetur in prima parte consuetudinum ordinis Carthusiensium}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 - \plain \f0\i\fs22 ... misericordiam absolucionem et orationem propter Deum. >Amen<.\plain \f0\fs22  Einteilung des Erweiterungsteils in neun Rubriken: (55\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -57\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De officio subdiaconatus. (57\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -93\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) De officio diaconatus. (93\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De officio sacristae. (166\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -177\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De lectura refectorii. (178\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -180\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De capitula monachorum. (181\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -184\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De capitula laicorum, moselfrk. (184\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -188\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) De fratribus laicis, moselfrk. (188\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -197\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Notae liturgicae. (197\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -200\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) De confessione cottidiana. 201\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -206\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

