\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 23\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -26\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ordinarium defunctorum}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f0\i\fs22 >In presencia sororis defuncte<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circumdederunt me gemitus mortis ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 17,4). }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Venite. Tunc incipient Beatus vir }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 1,1)}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - \plain \f0\fs22 (26\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... in novissimo die. >Ps< Domine probasti me \plain \f0\fs22 (Ps 138,2)\plain \f0\i\fs22 . >Super fossam< \plain \f0\fs22 (26\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >It is zo wijssen, dat dyt Ordinarium is gesat uss deme latijne in duytsche umme der myn geleirder willen, die dat latijn neit mail in verstaint, op dat sy de bas ire gezijde moegen bezalen na reichter usswijsongen irre choir boiche, die dar zo verbunden synt van ordens wegen ... Dyt is gescheit ind vollenbracht durch eyne arme sustergin profest in deme cloister zo Engeldail zer zijt gesant van gehoirsamheit zo deme cloister zo wijssen vrauwen bynnen Collen gelegen umme die yungen zo leren etc. ...Geschreven in den iaren unses heren dusent veirhundert ind veir ind seszich des seisten dages in deme merz<.}

