\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Ambrosius Mediolanensis}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 De officiis [ministrorum]}}\plain \f0\fs22 . (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -2\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis. (87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Explicit liber tercius beati Ambrosii episcopi de officiis scriptus et completus in Dalhem per fratrem Volmarum Decker de Paderborn conventualem inutilem et quasi septuagenarium anno domini M cccc\plain \f0\i\super\fs28 o\plain \f0\i\fs22  lxxx sexto ipso die beati Kalixti Pape et martyris \plain \f0\fs22 [14. Okt. 1486]\plain \f0\i\fs22  professionis vero eiusdem fratris Volmari quinto cum sex mensibus<.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 CCSL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 15, S. 1-206. Danach f\u252 \'fcnf Schreiberverse: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Iste liber totus est omni labe remotus / Officiis plenus est exemplis et amenus / Hunc fecit Ambrosius nobilis atque pius / O pater Ambrose per te satis officiose / Simus in officiis depositus viciis<.\plain \f0\fs22  Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen von Schreiberhand. 87\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -88\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

