\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 5\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -195\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Horarium}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . (5\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -16\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kalender}}\plain \f0\fs22 , frz. Heiligennamen der {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6923/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Di\u246 \'f6zese Reims}}\plain \f0\fs22 ; bemerkenswert Remigius (13. Jan. und 1. Okt., rot), Rigobertus (16. Juni), Theodericus abb. (1. Juli) und Nicasius (14. Dez.). (16\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Officium parvum beatae Mariae virginis. (88\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -107\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Septem psalmi poenitentiales cum Litania sanctorum (101\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -106\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ); Nicasius, Dionysius, Remigius (103\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) und Genoveva (104\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) signifikant f\u252 \'fcr Reims. (112\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -155\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Officium defunctorum nach dem Gebrauch von Reims, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Ottosen, Responsories, 1993}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 145. (156\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -160\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Oratio 'Obsecro te'. (161\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -165\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Oratio 'O intemerata'. (165\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -167\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Oratio ad Sanctum Michaelem. (156\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -160\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Oratio de septem ultimis verbis domini. Ed.: Ebd., Bd. 2, S. 378. (170\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -171\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Mehrere kurze Gebete, teilweise nachgetragen, darunter Antiphon de Sancto Leto: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 O Lete pastor omnium, fili obediencie}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (171\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ), Oratio ad beatam Mariam virginem: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 O beatissima virgo Maria, ecce iaceo tristis ante faciem tuam}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (172\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -177\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ). (177\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -195\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Gebete auf Maria, Christophorus, Sebastian, Apollina, darunter {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 7671 (177\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ); 17182 (178\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -183\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ); 17232 (189\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -190\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ). Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge auf urspr\u252 \'fcnglich leeren Seiten, mehrere H\u228 \'e4nde, 2. H. 15. Jh., darunter 'Stabat mater' (73\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -74\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ), zwei frz. Gebete auf Barbara (86\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 . 107\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -110\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  ), Gebet auf Christophorus (186\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) sowie Tropus, vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Chevalier, Repertorium, 1892-1921}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 21720 (195\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ).}

