\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [TE]. - III\plain \f0\super\fs28 6\plain \f0\fs22  + 7 VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 90\plain \f0\fs22  + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 100\plain \f0\fs22  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 112\plain \f0\fs22  + (VII-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 125\plain \f0\fs22  + (X-2)\plain \f0\super\fs28 143\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 151\plain \f0\fs22  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 163\plain \f0\fs22  + (VI)\plain \f0\super\fs28 175\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 + V\plain \f0\super\fs28 185\plain \f0\fs22  + (VII-1)\plain \f0\super\fs28 198\plain \f0\fs22  + VII\plain \f0\super\fs28 212\plain \f0\fs22  + VI\plain \f0\super\fs28 224\plain \f0\fs22  + VII\plain \f0\super\fs28 238\plain \f0\fs22  + IV\plain \f0\super\fs28 246\plain \f0\fs22  + I\plain \f0\super\fs28 248\plain \f0\fs22 . Lagenz\u228 \'e4hlung am Faszikelende in Rot, gotische Ziffern (II-X). Teilweise Reklamanten (II-III). Bl 164a Schaltzettel.\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 Zeit\-gen\u246 \'f6ssi\-sche Foliierung in Rot, eine Hand, E. 15. Jh. (II-X, vgl. dazu Inhaltsverzeichnis (I); fehlerhaft) \u183 \'b7 Schriftraum 15,5-17,5 \u215 \'d7 9-10,5 \u183 \'b7 2 Sp. (nur 49\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 \endash 71\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) \u183 \'b7 20 Z. (I); 30-32 Z. (II); 36-38 Z. (III); 30-34 Z. (IV); 38-46 Z. (V); 32-34 Z. (VI); 29-30 Z. (VII); 29-31\~Z. (VIII); 27-31\~Z. (IX); 30-31\~Z. (X) \u183 \'b7 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Hybri\-da}}\plain \f0\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , acht H\u228 \'e4nde \u183 \'b7 Vereinzelt {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5270[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Schemata}}\plain \f0\fs22  (IX) \u183 \'b7 Rubrizierung; Lombarden ver\-einzelt mit Aussparungen}

