\f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Aperite michi portas iustitie}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 (82\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -83\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Sanctus und Agnus Dei zu Marienfesten, tropiert. (83\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Vier Antiphonen auf Maria: Nr. 1 (83\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -84\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 50, Nr. 244; Nr. 2 (84\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -86\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): Ebd., Nr. 245 (Abweichungen); Nr. 3 (86\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 16516; Nr. 4 (86\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ): Ebd., Nr. 1969. (87\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -91\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) Proprium missae zur \plain \f0\i\fs22 Feria tertia pasce\plain \f0\fs22 , mit Introitus zur \plain \f0\i\fs22 Dominica in albis\plain \f0\fs22 . (91\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Inhaltsverzeichnis.}

