\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 83\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -87\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Busstraktat}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 En ontvrucht, dy niet aen te nemen een geestelick leven der penetencien, want voer die hardicheit des levens saltu myt Christo naemals ontfanghen ewighe vrude}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... ende comste toe ghebreck der sunden.}

