\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 195\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -203\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-Aurelius Augustinus}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Speculum peccatoris}}\plain \f0\fs22 ], ndl. \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Dit is der sunder spigel<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 O alre liefste broeders, want wi sijn in den wege deser vliender werlt}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... op dattu den ewigen doet ontgaen moghen ende myt Jhesum Christum eweliken leven mogest, dat moet hi ons verlenen, die in der ewicheit is. Amen.\plain \f0\fs22  Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Roth, S\u252 \'fcndenspiegel, 1991}}\plain \f0\fs22 , S. 183-226 (Hs auf S. 67f. genannt). Nachtrag: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Een Ave Maria vor die schriversche\plain \f0\fs22 . 203\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  leer.
