\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -14\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat18 Sermo in Apc 12,1}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. \plain \f0\i\fs22 Dit is een sermoen, woe dat Sunte Johan ewangelist een wijf sach ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18 Signum magnum apparuit ...< }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 (Apc 12,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat18 . Dese woerde beschrijft Sunte Johan ewangelist in Apocalipsi}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... een croen van XII sterren op oeren hoefde.\plain \f0\fs22  Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Ermens/Van Dijk}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 4, S. 354f.}

