\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 389\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -475\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Goslarer Stadtrecht}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\i\fs22 >Hier beghynt eyn ander boeck unde heytet Gosler recht, unde ys to den eyrsten, wu men erve nemmen unde geven zolle yn unser staet. Dat eyrste capitel<.\plain \f0\fs22  Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Eyn neyste nempt et.< Sone unde dochtere synt gelick erve}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...  - \plain \f0\fs22 (475\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... unde eer dan zey ute dem\plain \f0\fs22 (475\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\i\fs22 me rade gheneghen. >Hyer endyghet zick Gosleer recht in demme jare unses heren, do men schreiff dusent veyrhundert unde sestich uppe den saterdagh tho luttyghen vastaven ... in vigilia Mathei<\plain \f0\fs22  [23. Febr. 1460]\plain \f0\i\fs22 .\plain \f0\fs22  Ed. Wilhelm Ebel (Hg.): Das Stadtrecht von Goslar. G\u246 \'f6ttingen 1968, S. 31-182 (Abweichungen). 476\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -476\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  Nachgetragene Erbrechtsregeln, letztes Dr. 15. Jh. Am Ende Fragment durch Blattverlust.}

