\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -295\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Missale [Coloniense}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 ]\plain \f0\fs22 . Kalender mit erster Lage entfernt (s.o.). (1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -125\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Proprium de tempore, Pars hiemalis (Advent - Pfingstvigil). (125\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -126\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Ordo missae.\plain \f0\b\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 (126\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 -129\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Praefationes. (130\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -132\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Canon missae. (133\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -133\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Orationes. (133\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -180\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) Proprium de tempore, Pars aestivalis (Pfingsten - 25. Sonntag nach Pfingsten). (180\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -239\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Proprium de sanctis (Lucia - Damasius). Heiligennamen der Di\u246 \'f6zese K\u246 \'f6ln (192\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Heribertus, 210\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  Translatio trium regum, 218\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  Helena u.a.); Marienfeste durch Initialen herausgehoben. (239\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -256\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Commune sanctorum. (256\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -258\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) De dedicatione ecclesiae. (258\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -268\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Missae votivae et Orationes diversae; Marienfeste durch Initialen herausgehoben. (268\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -271\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Benedictiones. (271\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -276\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Missae defunctorum. (276\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -293\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) Sequentiae de sanctis. Sammlung von mindestens 66 Sequenzen (Textverluste); Anordnung nach dem kirchlichen Festkreis (Weihnachten - 4. Advent); Heiligennamen der Di\u246 \'f6zese K\u246 \'f6ln (282\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  Albinus, 284\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Translatio trium regum, 285\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22  Helena, 290\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  Gregorius pb. Spoletanus u.a.); am Ende (292\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -293\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 )\plain \f0\b\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 mehrere Mariensequenzen. Ed.: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 AH}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 53, Nr. 10; 16; 15; 215; 168; 156; 29; Bd. 54, Nr. 2; Bd. 55, Nr. 51; Bd. 50, Nr. 270; Bd. 53, Nr. 99; 36; 50; 45; Bd. 54, Nr. 6; 143; 18; Bd. 53, Nr. 82; 67; 70; Bd. 54, Nr. 153; Bd. 53, Nr. 83; Bd. 50, Nr. 243; 385; Bd. 42, Nr. 160; Bd. 53, Nr. 163; 210; Bd. 55, Nr. 238; Bd. 50, Nr. 267-268; Bd. 55, Nr. 331; 66 (Str. 1; 3-6); 162 (Erweiterungen); Bd. 50, Nr. 271; Bd. 55, Nr. 92; Bd. 10, Nr. 116; Bd. 55, Nr. 76; Bd. 53, Nr. 95; Bd. 54, Nr. 120; Bd. 53, Nr. 192; Bd. 55, Nr. 150; 333; Bd. 53, Nr. 196; Bd. 55, Nr. 121; 203; Bd. 53, Nr. 122; Bd. 42, Nr. 179; Bd. 54, Nr. 66 (Str. 1-22); Bd. 55, Nr. 155; Bd. 53, Nr. 247; 228; Bd. 42, Nr. 344; Bd. 55, Nr. 14; Bd. 53, Nr. 229; Bd. 54, Nr. 88; 92; 216; 245; 219; 218; Bd. 32, Nr. 14 (Str. 1-4, var.). Nicht identifiziert: Nr. 32 (285\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Frgm. am Anfang (Blattverlust, s.o.); Nr. 38 (286\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -286\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Jesu, o Christe, salus nostra Emanuel / Audi benignus}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22 ; Nr. 50 (290\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -290\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Letabunde altera iocundeque exultemus /}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ...;\plain \f0\fs22  Nr. 65 (293\plain \f0\super\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22 -293\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Inviolata et casta es Maria / Que es effecta / }}\plain \f0\i\fs22 ...\plain \f0\fs22  (293\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -295\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) Proprium de sanctis diversis. Heiligennamen der Di\u246 \'f6zese K\u246 \'f6ln (295\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  Gregorius pb. Spoletanus u.a.). Am Rand vereinzelt Glossen (Hinweise zum liturgischen Gebrauch, Gebete) von Schreiberhand sowie mehreren anderen H\u228 \'e4nden, 2. H. 14. - 16. Jh. Handwechsel.}

