\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 [VE]. \endash  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[0]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Hybrida}}\plain \f0\fs22  und/oder {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5704[1]/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat18 Kursive}}\plain \f0\fs22 , f\u252 \'fcnf H\u228 \'e4nde (Wolter de Eyndovia u.a.) \u183 \'b7 I\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Besitz\-vermerk: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Liber fra\-trum ca\-no\-ni\-co\-rum regularium in insula in opposito Valendar deprope Confluenciam\plain \f0\fs22 , um 1500; 150\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Schenkungs- bzw. Wid\-mungs\-vermerk: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Presentetur fratri Johanni Wees propter Deum\plain \f0\fs22 ; 209\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Besitzvermerk: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste liber pertinet Woltero Eyndovie. Si quis invenerit, reddit ei pro amore Dei\plain \f0\fs22 ; 210\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Besitzvermerk: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Wolterus \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eyn\-do\-vie est pres[byteri]\plain \f0\fs22 .}

