\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -151\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Vita rhythmica beatae Mariae virginis et salvatoris}}\plain \f0\fs22 . Ohne Epilog. (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipit prologus in vitam beate Marie. De infancia salvatoris\u8249 \'8b\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sanctus Ephyphanius et doctor veritatis / Salamine pontifex Cypri civitatis /}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ...\plain \f0\fs22  (1\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22 ) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bIncipit vita beate Marie\u8249 \'8b\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 In civitate Nazareth de terra Galilea / Homo quidam habitabat ortus ex Judaea /}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - ... Jesum Christum dominum, qui est benedictus / Omnia per secula permanes invictus. Amen. Nos cum prole pia / benedicat virgo Maria. Explicit Liber de infancia salvatoris. Deo gracias. Dei gracia et Dei virtus maneat semper nobiscum. Amen\plain \f0\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bExplicit liber ritmicus \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  de infancia et vita salvatoris ac beate Marie virginis matris eius\u8249 \'8b\plain \f0\fs22 . Ed.: Adolph V\u246 \'f6gtlin (Hg.): Vita beate virginis Maria et Salvatoris rythmica. T\u252 \'fcbingen 1888 (Bibliothek des Litterarischen (!) Vereins Stuttgart 180), S. 9-266 (vv. 1-7971). Zu Werk und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Stegm\u252 \'fcller, RB}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 9194; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Initia, 1969}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 8056; 17250; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 BHL}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 5374; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 VL (2)}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Bd. 10, Sp. 436-443 (Lit.); Max P\u228 \'e4pke: Das Marienleben des Schwei\-zers Wernher. Mit Nachtr\u228 \'e4gen zu V\u246 \'f6gtlins Ausgabe der Vita Mariae Rhythmica. Berlin 1913 (Pa\-lae\-stra 81), S. 9-11; 171-174. \u220 \'dcberlieferung auch {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Koblenz, LHA, Best. 701 Nr. 185}}\plain \f0\fs22 , 122\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -171\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rb\plain \f0\fs22  (Ehrenbreitstein bei Koblenz, 1436, danach in Niederwerth, CRV), vgl. Kat. KO 1, S.\~429\endash 431 (Lit.). 152\plain \f1\super\lang1033\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

