\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 2\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -340\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Matthias Pahe}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  (?): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Glossa super Psalmos}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 . \plain \f0\fs22 Kompilation unterschiedlicher Quellen, vereinzelt (213\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -215\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 ) mit Interlinear- und Klammerglosse \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 (\plain \f0\fs22 1\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -212\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22  Ps 1-33. 213\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -215\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22  Ps \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 32-35\plain \f0\fs22 . 218\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -285\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Ps 34-39. 292\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -301\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Ps 109-116. 304\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 -340\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Ps 40-81. 83-89. 91-108. 117-119. 134-149 (Kurzfassung)\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 )\plain \f0\fs22 . Invocatio: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Assit in principio Sancta Maria mea.\plain \f0\fs22  Prolog: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Circa inicium huius libri sex sunt<. Circa principium huius psalterii sunt sex premittenda }}\plain \f0\i\fs22 ... \plain \f0\fs22 (3\plain \f0\super\fs28 ra\plain \f0\fs22 ) Text: \plain \f0\i\fs22 >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Beatus vir, qui non abiit in< }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Ps 1,1)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Circa principium psalmi est notandum, quod quinque sunt interrogande}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... omnis spiritus laudet dominum. Et sic est finis huius libri per manus Mathie ... \plain \f0\fs22 340\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -340a\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\i\fs22  \plain \f0\fs22 Nachtrag zu Lk 1,68 (Canticum Zachariae) von Schreiberhand; Kolophon: \plain \f0\i\fs22 Et sic sunt finita huius partis notabilia per me Mathiam Pahe Erffordie reportata. \plain \f0\fs22 Am Rand sowie auf acht Schaltzetteln (s.o.) vereinzelt Glossen, Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge (darunter auch 285\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -291\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 .  301\plain \f0\super\fs28 vb\plain \f0\fs22 -303\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  Tabulae materiarum) und Korrekturen von Schreiberhand. 340a\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  Theologische Notizen von Schreiberhand.}

