\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 349\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -359\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f0\scaps\fs22 [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Pseudo-]Hugo de Sancto Victore}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22  [{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 Hugo de Sancto Caro}}\plain \f0\scaps\fs22 ]: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\scaps\fs22\chcbpat17 [Tractatus super missam seu] Speculum ecclesiae}}\plain \f0\fs22 . {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 Dicit apostolus ad Ephesios via: Induite vos ... }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 (Eph 6,11)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\i\fs22\chcbpat17 . Hec armatura est vestis sacerdotalis}}\plain \f0\i\fs22  ... - ... que precedunt et subsequitur hominem in bonis operibus. Et sic est finis illius. \plain \f0\fs22 Ed.: Gisbert S\u246 \'f6lch (Hrsg.): Hugonis a St. Charo (!) Tractatus super missam seu Speculum ecclesiae. M\u252 \'fcnster 1940 (Opuscula et textus historiam ecclesiae eiusque vitam atque doctrinam illustrantia, Ser. liturgica 9), S. 8-55. Ed.: Gisbert S\u246 \'f6lch (Hrsg.): Hugonis a St. Charo (!) Tractatus super missam seu Speculum ecclesiae. M\u252 \'fcnster 1940 (Opuscula et textus historiam ecclesiae eiusque vitam atque doctrinam illustrantia, Ser. liturgica 9), S. 8-55. Zu Werk  und \u220 \'dcberlieferung vgl. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Bloomfield/Guyot, Incipits, 1979}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1589; {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Kaeppeli, ScriptOP, 1970}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 1990 (Hs genannt); {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f0\fs22\chcbpat17 Glorieux, Ma\u238 \'eetres, 1933-1934}}\plain \f0\fs22 , Nr. 2aw. 359\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22 -360\plain \f0\super\fs28 va\plain \f0\fs22  nachgetragene Notizen von Schreiberhand zu theologischen, liturgischen und moralphilosophischen Fragen.}

