\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 162\plain \f0\super\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -164\plain \f0\super\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Mariengebet}}\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bDu salt alle sonnen dage sprecken vier Ave Maria der vrouden onser liever vrouwen toe eeren, die sy had\plain \f0\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 aen den oisterlicken dach. Ende dese gebeden daer toe ...\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ick vermaen dy, heilige Maria, vrouwe van hemelrick, der groeten vrouden, die dyne moe\-derlicke herte hadden opten heiligen pasdach}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 -\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... yck bidde dy, dattu myne ziele ver\-vrouwes nae oerre doet ende alle gelovige zielen ende brengen sy in dynre hi[...] \plain \f0\fs22 [unleserlich]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  hul\-pen ende genaden toter ewige vrouden ende blytschoppen. AMEN. \plain \f0\fs22 165\plain \f0\super\fs28 rv\plain \f0\fs22  leer.}

