\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 166\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -193\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Abendmahlsbetrachtung}}\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bHier begynt dat heilige aventmael, dat ons lieve here gehalden heeft myt synen lieven yongere\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Des donredachs des margens scheide onse lieve here van Bethanyen myt synen lieven jongeren ende syn lieven moeder verwaerff dat kommen, dat sy ende Maria Magdalena en Martha en Lasarus eyn deil des weges mochten myt hem gaen}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \~... Ende onderwegen sprack hr \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  den Gracias ende den Psalmen \u8218 \'82Misere\rquote  \plain \f0\fs22 (!)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  mei, Deus. \u8250 \'9bAMEN\u8249 \'8b.\plain \f0\fs22  Handwechsel.}

