\pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f0\fs22 274\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 r\plain \f0\fs22 -318\plain \f2\super\lang1033\fs28 v\plain \f0\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dankendes Pascha}}\plain \f0\fs22 , ndl. Fragment am Ende. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8250 \'9bHier begynt dat danckende pasken ons lieven heren Jhesus Christus, dat seer guetlic \plain \f0\fs22 (?)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  gelesen \plain \f0\fs22 (!) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 is\u8249 \'8b. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Ick danck u, lieve here, der groter bangicheit, die gy dryendertich jaer geleden hebt op eertrick gelyckt eynen mynschen, dye op syn verscheyden lyckt }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666v/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f0\fs22 -\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22  ... Ytem gelick colde calen aen eyn vurygen coel en hoelt aent vur ontfincten, soe verweckt eyn torind mynsche kyff-\plain \f0\fs22  || Text bricht ab.}

